  <para style="h">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marko Manye Munyu Ɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marko Manye Munyu Ɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Yesu Kristo, Mawu Bi ɔ, e nyakpɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ngɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia womi ɔ mi ɔ, e ngma ke Mawu ma ha nɛ e Bi ɔ maa ba je nɛ ɔ mi; se loko ji e maa ba a, e maa tsɔ tsɔlɔ pɔtɛɛ ko kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ e ba dla blɔ ngɔ fɔ si ha e bami ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Yesaia ngma ke, “Gbi ko ngɛ pɛe ngɛ nga a nɔ ke, nyɛ dla Nutsɔ ɔ blɔ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ pee mɛ tlɔmɔɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ fiemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Tsɔlɔ pɔtɛɛ nɛ ɔ biɛ ji Yohane Baptisilɔ. E hi nga nɔ nɛ e fiɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui nɛ a sɔle nyɛ konɛ Mawu nɛ wo nyɛ tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke nyɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nihi fuu je Yerusalem kɛ Yudea zugba a nɔ kɛ ho e ngɔ ya nɛ a ya hyɛ lɛ ha nɛ a bu lɛ tue. Nɛ benɛ a jaje a he yayami ɔmɛ ɔ, e baptisi mɛ ngɛ Yordan Pa a mi. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohane nɛ ɔ, yoma he bwɔmi tade nɛ e wo, lohwe he womi kpa fi e mlɛ mi, nɛ nga nɔ baalɛhi kɛ hwo pɛ ji e niye ni. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />E ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ dee ke, “Nɔ ko nɛ kle kulaa pe mi ma; nɔ ko nɛ i sɛ kaa i pineɔ e tokota nya kpa tete po. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ami lɛɛ nyu kɛkɛ nɛ i kɛ ngɛ nyɛ baptisie, se lɛɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ e ma kɛ baptisi nyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ligbi ko ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, Yesu je Nazaret ngɛ Galilea kɛ ba Yohane ngɔ nɛ Yohane baptisi lɛ ngɛ Yordan Pa a mi. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Benɛ Yohane baptisi lɛ ta nɛ Yesu je kpo ngɛ nyu ɔ mi ɔ, e na hiɔwe nya nɛ bli nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ si kplee kaa lahuɛ kɛ ma e ngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Nɛ gbi ko de kɛ je hiɔwe ke, “Mo ji ye suɔmi Bi ɔ nɛ, nɛ ye bua jɔɔ o he saminya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Amlɔ ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ wo lɛ kɛ ho nga a nɔ ya. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />E ya hi nga a nɔ ligbi nyingmi eywiɛ ngɛ nga mi lohwehi a kpɛti nɛ Abosiami ba ka lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, bɔfo ɔmɛ ba sɔmɔ lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Pee se ɔ, benɛ Matsɛ Herode nu Yohane kɛ wo tsu mi ɔ, Yesu ba Galilea nɛ e ba fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ e de ke, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />“Si ko nɛ a wo ɔ, e be su. Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ su si ta. Nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui nɛ nyɛ he Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ekomɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ligbi ko benɛ Yesu ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ Galilea Wo ɔ nya a, e na Simon kɛ e nyɛmi Andrea nɛ a ngɛ hɛe, ejakaa wo yali ji mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ mɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba nyɛɛ ye se nɛ ma pee nyɛ nimli a klaahi a yi wami heli.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, a si a ya amɛ nɛ a ya bɔni Yesu se nyɛɛmi.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Benɛ e ya e hɛ mi bɔɔ ɔ, e na Yakobo kɛ Yohane nɛ ji Zebedeo bimɛ ɔmɛ nɛ mɛ hu a hii si ngɛ a lɛ ɔ mi ngɛ ya mi kpɛe. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ mɛ nɛ mɛ hu a si a tsɛ Zebedeo kɛ e apaa yeli ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi nɛ a ya nyɛɛ e se.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu kɛ nihi nɛ e tsɛ ɔmɛ tsa a nyɛɛmi ɔ nɔ kɛ ya su Kapernaum. Nɛ Hɔ nɛ ji Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ mɔtu ɔ, a ho Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔ ya nɛ Yesu ya tsɔɔ ni ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Yesu ni tsɔɔmi ɔ pee ni ɔmɛ nyakpɛ saminya, ejakaa e tsɔɔ mɛ ni kaa nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ e ngɛ dee ɔ nɔ he wami; e ni tsɔɔmi ɔ je ekpa kulaa ngɛ womi ngmali ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ he.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa hiɔ slɔɔtohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Tlukaa a, nyumu ko nɛ e be saminya, ejakaa mumi yayamihi ngɛ nɔ dee ha lɛ ɔ te si ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e hia ngmlaa ke, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Mɛni he je o ngɛ wɔ haoe, Yesu Nazaret nɔ? Wa hɛ mi kpatami nɛ o ba lo? I le o mi tso; mo ji Mawu Bi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Se Yesu ka mumi ɔ hɛ mi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “O nya nɛ jɔ; moo je kpo ngɛ e mi!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Nɛ benɛ mumi yayami ɔ huanya nɔmlɔ tso ɔ wawɛɛ nɛ e po lɛ ngɔ fia si ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ ɔ kpa ngmlaa nɛ mumi yayami ɔ hia kɛ je e mi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Kikɛmɛ a nɔ nɛ ɔ pee nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nyakpɛ saminya nɛ a bi ke, “Mɛni ji enɛ ɔ, tsɔɔmi he ko ba je kpo ngɛ wa kpɛti. E ngaa mumi yayamihi po a yi nɛ a buɔ tue nɛ a he jɔɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Sane nɛ ɔ ha nɛ Yesu biɛ pɛ ngɛ Galilea zugba a mi tsuo.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Benɛ a je kpe he ɔ nɔuu ɔ, a ho Simon kɛ Andrea a we ɔ mi ya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Nɛ a ya na Simon nganyɛ nɛ asla yobu ko fia lɛ nɛ e pee kpotoo ke hwɔɔ si. Kɛkɛ nɛ a de Yesu nɔuu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu be kɛ ho hiɔtsɛ ɔ ngɔ ya nɛ e ya nu yo ɔ nine si nɛ e wo e nɔ kɛ da si nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, asla a po ngɛ e nɔ nɛ e sɔmɔ mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Gbɔkuɛ benɛ pu nɔ si se ɔ, nihi fuu wo a hiɔtsɛhi kɛ nihi hu nɛ mumi yayamihi ngɛ nɔ dee ha mɛ ɔ kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ konɛ e tsa mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ agbo ɔ nya tsuo hyi tɔ kɛ nimli babauu nɛ je Kapernaum. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nɛ Yesu tsa hiɔtsɛ slɔɔto ɔmɛ nɛ e hia mumi yayami ɔmɛ ngɛ nihi a mi. E ha we mumi yayami ɔmɛ blɔ nɛ a tu munyu ko kulaa, ejakaa mumi yayami ɔmɛ le e mi tso kaa Mawu Bi ji lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />E nɔ jena makɛ mla nɛ je mi tsɔ we lolo ɔ, e te si nɛ e je kpo kɛ ho nga nɔ he ko ya nɛ e ya sɔle ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Pee se ɔ, Simon kɛ e huɛ ɔmɛ bɔni lɛ hlami; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />nɛ benɛ a ya na lɛ ɔ, a de lɛ ke, “Mo nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ waa ho kɔpe ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ kasa mi ɔmɛ a mi ya nɛ ma ya fiɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔmɛ hu, ejakaa fiɛmi ɔ he nɛ i ba ngɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nɛ Yesu kpa Galilea zugba nɔ kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ kulaa mi nɛ e fiɛ ngɛ a kpe he ɔmɛ nɛ e hiaa mumi yayami ɔmɛ ngɛ nihi a mi. <verse eid="MRK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ligbi ko ɔ, kpititsɛ ko ba Yesu ngɔ nɛ e ba kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ e kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke, “Ke o suɔ ɔ, o ma nyɛ ma tsa mi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Hiɔtsɛ ɔ ni pee Yesu mɔbɔ nɛ e sɔle e nine nɛ e ta e he nɛ e de lɛ ke, “I suɔ, kpiti ɔ nɛ e ta ha mo!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Yesu nya nɔɛ si nɛ kpititsɛ ɔ na he wami.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu wo lɛ blɔ, nɛ e wo lɛ si veveeve ke, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Yaa nɔuu; o kɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko tu munyu ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ, nɛ o wo o he kɛ ya tsɔɔ osɔfo ɔ; konɛ o hɛɛ bɔ sami nɔ́ ɔmɛ nɛ Mose to ha kpititsɛmɛ nɛ na tsami ɔ, nɛ a kɛ ye o he odase kaa jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ hiɔ ɔ jɔ ha mo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Se benɛ nyumu ɔ je Yesu ngɔ nɔuu pɛ nɛ e bɔni nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e kɛ maa kpe ɔ nɔ nɛ Yesu pee ha lɛ ɔ demi. E kɛ we nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nu hiɔ nɛ ɔ tsami ɔ he ngɛ Galilea kulaa, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ Yesu nyɛ we nɛ e sɛɛ ma ko mi ngɛ paa mi hu, ejakaa he tsuaa he nɛ e maa gu ɔ nimli babauu ba buaa woɔ e he. Ja a he ɔ, he nɛ Yesu hii ji nga nɔ nɛ nihi jee mahimahi a mi kɛ baa e ngɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Maa pee ligbi saii se ɔ, Yesu kpale kɛ ba Kapernaum, kɛkɛ nɛ a nu e he nɔuu kaa e ba ma a mi nɛ e ngɛ we mi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />E kɛ we nɛ nihi bɔni bumi pue e nɔ kɛ ya si benɛ we ɔ mi hyi tɔ, nɛ agbo ɔ nya hu tsi nɛ a nɛ blɔ ngɛ he ko hu. Nɛ Yesu fiɛ Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nihi eywiɛ komɛ tloo nɔ ko nɛ e ninehi kɛ e nanehi gbo kɛ ba ke Yesu nɛ e tsa lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Benɛ ni ɔmɛ na kaa blɔ be nɛ a ma kɛ wo nɔ ɔ kɛ su Yesu he mi ɔ, a kuɔ tsu ɔ nɛ a hia tsu ɔ yi mi. A wo hiɔtsɛ ɔ kɛ e sa nɛ e hwɔɔ si ngɛ nɔ ɔ tsuo kɛ gu lejɛ ɔ kɛ kple tsu ɔ mi kɛ ba fɔ Yesu hɛ mi.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Nɛ Yesu na nihi nɛ wo nɔ ɔ kɛ ba amɛ a hemi kɛ yemi kaa e nya wa a, e de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, “Binyumu, a wo o tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke mo!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Se Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ekomɛ ngɛ nihi nɛ ba lejɛ ɔ a kpɛti, nɛ a nu nɔ́ nɛ Yesu de ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />Kɛkɛ ɔ nɔ́ nɛ a susu ji, “Mɛni he je nɔ nɛ ɔ tu munyu kaa kikɛ ɔ? Pi musu nɛ e bɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo? Ngɛ Mawu se ɔ, mɛnɔ hu pa ngɛ nɛ ma nyɛ wo nɔ ko he yayami kɛ ke lɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Se Yesu na nɔ́ nɛ a susu ngɛ a yi mi ɔ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu, nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ enɛ ɔ ngɛ nyɛ haoe? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kaa a ma de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, ‘A wo o tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke mo’ aloo ‘Moo te si nɛ o wo o sa a nɛ o nyɛɛ ɔ, a ti te nɔ nɛ peemi wa nɛɛ’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ le mwɔnɛ ɔ kaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ he wami ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e woɔ tɔmi ngɔ keɔ,” e plɛ hyɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“I ngɛ mo dee ke, moo te si nɛ o wo o sa a nɛ o ho we mi ya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Yesu nya nɔɛ si nɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ te si nɛ e wo e sa a ngɛ nimli asafo nɛ ba pue si ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ e nyɛɛ e nane nɔ kɛ je kpo. Enɛ ɔ pee nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nyakpɛ nɛ a je Mawu yi nɛ a de ke, “Enɛ ɔ lɛɛ wa nɛ eko hyɛ gblee!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu je kpo ekohu kɛ ho wo ɔ nya ya nɛ nihi fuu bu e nɔ kɛ ya lejɛ ɔ nɛ e fiɛ ha mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Benɛ e ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ wo ɔ nya a, e na Levi nɛ ji Alfeo bi ɔ nɛ e hii si ngɛ e lapoo tsumi he ɔ, nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo ba nyɛɛ ye se.” Nɛ Levi te si nɛ e nyɛɛ Yesu se.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ gbɔkuɛ ɔ, Levi tsɛ okplɔɔ nɛ e tsɛ Yesu kɛ nihi nɛ e kɛ mɛ ngɛ nyɛɛe ɔ kɛ lapoo tsuli kpahi nɛ e kɛ mɛ tsuɔ ni ɔ kɛ yayami peeli kpanakuhi kpahi fuu nɛ nyɛɛ Yesu se ɔ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ba ye ni. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Se benɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ekomɛ na kaa Yesu kɛ nimli slɔɔto nɛ ɔmɛ hii si ngɛ ni yee ɔ, a bi e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Kɛ peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ e kɛ nimli kaa kikɛ ɔ nɛ a ji yayami peeli, lapoo tsuli kɛ ojo fiali a hii si nɛ a yeɔ ni kɛɛ? Pe e li a mi tso lo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu nu a sane bimi ɔ nɛ e ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Hiɔtsɛ nɛ tsopatsɛ he hia, tsopatsɛ he hia we nɔmlɔ nɛ ngɛ kpakpataa. I bɛ ngɛ dali a he, se mohu yayami peeli a he nɛ i ba ngɛ nɛ a tsake a tsui.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hwɔ hami he munyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a jami blɔ nya tomi kɛ a kusumi nya a, a hiɔɔ ngma. Ja a nɔuu Yohane kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ hu peeɔ. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ni komɛ ba bi Yesu ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ moo lɛɛ o kaseli ɔmɛ yeɔ ni be fɛɛ be nɛ a hí ngma a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Nɛ Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ ayɛflo ɔ huɛmɛ maa fi nya nɛ niye ni be a nya mi yae be mi nɛ ayɛflo ɔ ngɛ yo kpee? Anɛ a bua be a he jɔe be mi nɛ e kɛ mɛ ngɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Se o nɛ, be ma nɛ a ma wo a huɛ ɔ kɛ je a he nɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi loko ji a maa hiɔ ngma a nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Mɛnɔ woɔ bo he kɛ taa bo momo? Bo momo ɔ ma gba nɛ pa a maa kle. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Nɛ mɛnɔ woɔ wai he kɛ woɔ wai tɔ momo mi? Da a nya wa nɛ tɔ ɔ ma pɛ nɛ da a ma pue si. Da he ɔ, tɔ he mi nɛ a kɛ woɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Be ko ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nyɛɛ kɛ ya gu blɛfo ngmɔ ko mi. Hwɔ ngɛ kaseli ɔmɛ yee nɛ a kpɔ blɛfo ɔ eko nɛ a ngɛ kpee.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Yuda nikɔtɔma amɛ ekomɛ bi Yesu ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ o kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ wa Hejɔɔmi Ligbi mlaa a nɔ tɔe ɔ? Blɛfo ɔ nɛ a ngɛ kpɔe ngɛ kpee ɔ, ni nɛ a ngɛ tsue ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e bi ke, “Anɛ nyɛ kai we nɔ nɛ David kɛ e huɛ ɔmɛ pee ngɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma Abiata yi nɔ benɛ hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Kaa a ya sɛ he nɛ tsɔ pe kulaa ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a ya ye abolo nɛ a kɛ ma Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ ngɛ mlaa a nya a, osɔfohi pɛ nɛ ngɛ he blɔ nɛ a yeɔ ɔ lo?” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nɔmlɔ he nɛ a to Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ ngɛ; se tsa pi Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ he nɛ a bɔ Nɔmlɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ja a he ɔ, Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ po nɔ he wami.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ligbi kpa ko ɔ, Yesu ya kpe he ɔ ekohu nɛ e ya na nyumu ko nɛ e nine kake gbo.<verse eid="MRK 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu he nyɛli ɔmɛ bɔni lɛ huɔmi kaa e ma tsa hiɔtsɛ ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ lo, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na e he blɔ nɛ a nu lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu tsɛ hiɔtsɛ ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke e ba da si ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e plɛ e he nɛ e bi asafo ɔ ke, “Anɛ e da kaa a peeɔ kpakpa aloo a peeɔ yayami ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ? Anɛ e sa kaa a heɔ yi wami aloo a kpataa nɛ hɛ mi?” Se a ti nɔ ko pui e nya mi. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />E po hɛ kɛ abofu nɛ e hyɛ a hɛ mi kɛ kpe, nɛ e hao, ejakaa e na kaa mɔbɔ nami be a mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e de hiɔtsɛ ɔ ke, “Moo bɔle o nine ɔ!” Hiɔtsɛ ɔ bɔle e nine ɔ nɛ nɔuu ɔ, he wami ba nine ɔ mi.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ je kpo ngɛ kpe he ɔ nɛ a ho nɛ a kɛ Herode bi ɔmɛ ya susu bɔ nɛ a maa pee nɛ a nine maa su Yesu nɔ nɛ a kpata e hɛ mi he. <verse eid="MRK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ je Kapernaum kɛ ho wo ɔ nya ya nɛ nihi fuu nyɛɛ e se kɛ je Galilea kɛ Yudea. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Nihi hu je Yerusalem kɛ Idumea kɛ Yordan se kɛ hehi tsitsaa kaa Tiro kɛ Zidon ba e ngɔ, ejakaa a nu nyakpɛ nihi nɛ e ngɛ pee ɔmɛ a he, nɛ nihi fuu ba konɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ba na kɛ a hɛ ngmɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ni ɔmɛ a hiɛmi he je ɔ, e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke a hla lɛ ko kɛ fɔ si ha lɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke ni ɔmɛ ma fifi lɛ tsɔ ɔ nɛ e sɛ mi kɛ ya pa a nɔ bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ejakaa e tsa hiɔtsɛmɛ babauu jamɛ a ligbi ɔ, nɛ hiɔtsɛmɛ fuu ngɛ bae lolo nɛ a ngɛ e he blɔ hlae nɛ a ta e he nɛ e tsa mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Nɛ nihi nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ a mi ɔ lɛɛ ke a ke a naa lɛ pɛ kɛkɛ a wo a he kɛ ngɛ si fiae ngɛ e hɛ mi kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Mo ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Se Yesu hu bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ke a ko tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ mimi nɛ e hine.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a hlami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu ho yoku ɔ nɔ ya nɛ e tsɛ nihi nɛ e hla amɛ a ti ni komɛ ke a nyɛɛ e se, nɛ a kɛ lɛ ho. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />E hla a kpɛti ni nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ngɔ pee e kaseli nɛ e maa tsɔ nɛ a ya fiɛ; <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />nɛ e ha mɛ he wami nɛ a kɛ hia mumi yayamihi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Nihi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ e hla a ji: Simon, nɔ nɛ Yesu wo lɛ “Petro” ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo kɛ Yohane nɛ ji Zebedeo bi ɔmɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛɛ mɛ ke, “Oslabai bimɛ” ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ ji: Andrea kɛ Filipo kɛ Bartolomeo kɛ Mateo kɛ Toma kɛ Yakobo nɛ ji Alfeo bi ɔ, kɛ Tadeo kɛ Simon nɛ je Kana a, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />kɛ Yuda Iskariot, nɔ nɛ pee se nɛ e tsɔɔ Yesu se blɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e kɛ e kaseli nɛ ɔmɛ ho we mi ya. Nɛ nihi fuu ba bu a nɔ ekohu bɔ nɛ a na we he blɔ nɛ a wo a nya mi nɔ ko po. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Se benɛ e huɛmɛ nu he ɔ, a ba nɛ a ba wo lɛ kɛ je ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ ho a we mi ya, ejakaa nihi ngɛ dee ke “e yi mi ngɛ puɛe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɔmi nɛ a kɛ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ je Yerusalem kɛ ba a hu de ke Beelzebul nɛ ji Abosiamihi a tsɛ ɔ nɛ je lɛ, nɛ e he wami nya nɛ e nyɛ hiaa mumi yayami kpa amɛ ngɛ nihi a mi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ tu munyu ngɛ abɛ mi ke, “Kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ Abosiami maa fie e he kɛɛ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ke ma ko te si kɛ wo lɛ nitsɛ e he nɛ e mi gba a, jamɛ a ma a maa ywia. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Nɛ ke we ko mi gba pɛ jamɛ a we ɔ maa ywia. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Nɛ ke Abosiami kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e he ngɛ ta hwue ɔ, lɛɛ tse e we ɔ be si dae mɔ, e maa gu. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Mɛnɔ nɛ e ma nyɛ ya sɛ katsɛ loo he walɔ ko we mi nɛ e muɔ e weto ni kulaa be mi nɛ e nui lɛ nɛ e fi lɛ kɛ fɔ si?<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, a ma wo nɔmlɔ adesa e yayami slɔɔto nɛ e peeɔ ɔ kulaa ngɔ ke lɛ, kɛ musu bɔmi munyu tsuaa musu bɔmi munyu nɛ e maa tu kɛ si Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ; <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />se musu bɔmi munyu nɛ a maa tu kɛ si Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ, e ji tɔmi nɛ a be woe kɛ ke kɔkɔɔkɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu de mɛ enɛ ɔ, ejakaa a ngɛ dee ke Abosiami he wami nya nɛ e ngɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ hiae ngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu nyɛ kɛ e nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ ba su lejɛ ɔ nɛ a tsɔ ke a ya tsɛ Yesu ha mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Nihi fuu hii si kɛ bɔle Yesu, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a wo sɛ ɔ kɛ mane lɛ ke e nyɛ kɛ e nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ hlae ngɛ agbo ɔ nya.<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu ha sɛ ɔ heto nɛ e bi ke, “Mɛnɔ ji ye nyɛ aloo ye nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Nɛ benɛ e po he nɛ e hyɛ nimli nɛ pue si kɛ bɔle lɛ ɔ, e de ke, “Ni nɛ ɔmɛ ji ye nyɛ kɛ ye nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ buɔ Mawu tue nɛ e peeɔ Mawu suɔmi nya ni ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ ji ye nyɛ kɛ ye nyɛminyumu kɛ ye nyɛmiyo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsɔɔ ni ɔmɛ ní</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ligbi kpa a, Yesu ya ngɛ ni tsɔɔe ekohu ngɛ wo ɔ nya nɛ nihi fuu ba nɛ a ba bu lɛ tue. Ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a hiɛmi he je ɔ, e ya sɛ lɛ mi loko ji e bɔni mɛ ni tsɔɔmi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ nihi fuu kɛ gu abɛhi a mi nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Nyɛɛ bu tue! Ligbi ko ɔ, ngmɔ hulɔ ko ho ni dumi ya. Benɛ e bɔni ni ɔ fiami ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue blɔ he nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ba mii mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue tɛ sahi a nɔ he nɛ zu hiɛ́ ngɛ. Wu ɔmɛ puɛ nɛ a wa mlamlaamla, ejakaa zu ɔ mi kuɔ we. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Nɛ akɛnɛ zu ɔ mi kuɔ we he je ɔ, nɔ́ ɔmɛ na we sipoku kpakpa ko. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nɛ pu ɔ nya bɔni wami bɔɔ pɛ kɛkɛ nɛ a ngla. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue miohi a mi, nɛ mio ɔmɛ gbe mɛ, ejakaa a na we he blɔ nɛ a wa nɛ a wo yiblii. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Se wu ɔ ekomɛ hu ya pue zugba kpakpa nɔ nɛ a puɛ, nɛ a wa nɛ a wo saminya, ekomɛ wo bɔ nɛ a du ɔ ngwɔ he nyingmi etɛ, ekomɛ ngwɔ he nyingmi ekpa, ekomɛ hu lafa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue nɛ e kɛ maa nu ɔ, e nu.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Pee se benɛ e piɛ e kɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ kɛ e kaseli kpa amɛ ɔ, a bi lɛ ke, “Kɛ ji abɛ ɔ sisi kɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ lɛɛ a ha nyɛ he blɔ kaa nyɛɛ le Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi laami sane ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɔ laa ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ se nɛ a be Matsɛyemi ɔ mi ɔ; mɛɛ lɛɛ abɛ mi nɛ a maa tu mɛ munyu ngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />‘Konɛ a maa na lɛɛ se a be se kɔe; nɛ a ma na maa nu kɛ a tue se a be sisi nue; konɛ a ko kpale kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e kɛ a he yayami ɔmɛ nɛ ke mɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Nɛ ke nyɛ hu nyɛ nui abɛ nɛ ɔ sisi ɔ, kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ maa nu abɛ kpahi nɛ i bu ɔmɛ a sisi kɛɛ?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ni dulɔ ɔ ji nɔ ko nɛ ya fiɛɔ Munyu ɔ kɛ haa ni kpahi. Nɛ Munyu ɔ ji wu ɔ nɛ ni dulɔ ya ngɛ fiae ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Blɔ he he nɛ wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue ɔ daa si kɛ ha nihi nɛ nuɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ a ti nihi nɛ a tsui wa nɛ ke a nu Munyu ɔ, Abosiami baa nɛ e haa a hɛ jee Munyu ɔ nɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Tɛ sa nɔ he nɛ wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue ɔ daa si kɛ ha nihi a tsui, ni nɛmɛ nɛ nuɔ Munyu ɔ nɛ a heɔ lɛ atuu kɛ bua jɔmi, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />se e pi si ngɛ a mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke amanehlu te si aloo haomi ba a nɔ ngɛ Munyu ɔ he ɔ, kɛkɛ ɔ, a ngmɛɛ Munyu ɔ he nɔuu.<verse eid="MRK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mio zugba he nɛ wu ɔ ekomɛ ya pue ɔ daa si kɛ ha nihi a tsui, ni nɛmɛ nɛ buɔ Munyu ɔ tue nɛ a heɔ Munyu ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />se e kɛ we nɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ngɔɔmi nihi kɛ sika suɔmi kɛ ni kpahi ba tsakaa a juɛmi nɛ a wui yiblii.<verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Se zugba kpakpa a tsɔɔ nihi nɛ nuɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ a pɛtɛɔ he anɔkuale mi, nɛ e waa ngɛ a mi nɛ a woɔ yiblii fuu kɛ bɔɔ he, ekomɛ ngwɔ he nyingmi etɛ, ekomɛ ngwɔ he nyingmi ekpa, nɛ ekomɛ hu ngwɔ he lafa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Nɛ e ya nɔ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ hu suɔ kane nɛ e woɔ nɔ́ ngɔ buɔ nɔ, aloo e tsitsɛɛɔ kaneɔ kɛ woɔ sa tso sisi? Tsa pi nɔ́ nɛ ya hiɔmi nɔ nɛ e kɛ maa konɛ e he nɛ ba se nami.<verse eid="MRK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Nɔ́ ko be nɛ a pee ngɔ laa nɛ e be kpo jee ligbi ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ tue nɛ e ma kɛ nu ɔ, e nu! <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Nyɛɛ bu nihi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nue nɛ ɔmɛ tue saminya nɛ nyɛ kɔ se. Susumi nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ susu nɔ́ kɛ ha ni kpahi ɔ, jamɛ a susumi nɔ́ ɔ nɔuu a ma kɛ susu kɛ ha nyɛ hu kɛ e nɔngmɛ. Si abɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ nu ɔ he ni tsue ɔ, si abɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ sisi nue ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. Se ke nyɛ tsu we he ni ɔ, bɔbɔyoo ɔ nɛ nyɛ nu ɔ hu nyɛ hɛ maa je nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ ní ko ɔ, a ma ha lɛ eko kɛ piɛ he; nɛ nɔ nɛ be eko o, bɔbɔyoo ɔ nɛ e ngɛ ɔ hu a ma he ngɛ e dɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Nɛ e bu mɛ abɛ kpa ko hu nɛ e de ke, “Bɔ nɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ ngɛ ha ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. E ngɛ kaa bɔ nɛ ngmɔ hulɔ ya duɔ blɛfo ngɛ e ngmɔ mi, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />nɛ e je e he ya hwɔɔ si. Be saii se ɔ, blɛfo ɔ puɛɛ nɛ e waa nɛ ngmɔ hulɔ ɔ li bɔ nɛ ni ɔ peeɔ kɛ waa ha. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Zugba a nɛ haa ni ɔmɛ waa a nɛ. Kekleekle ɔ, blɛfo ɔ puɛɛ nɛ e jeɔ ba; lɔ ɔ se ɔ, e kpaa bi nɛ e gbɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Nɛ ke blɛfo ɔ gbli pɛ ngmɔtsɛ ɔ tsɔɔ e we bi kɛ yaa ngmɔ ɔ mi nɛ a ya kpɔɔ blɛfo ɔ, ejakaa ni kpami be ɔ su.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />E pa bu mɛ abɛ kpa ko hu ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he nɛ wa ma wo Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ kɛ to? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />E ngɛ kaa wu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke sinapi wu. Wu nɛ ɔ ji wuhi a kpɛti wu nɛ klee we pe kulaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Se ke a du lɛ nɛ e puɛ ɔ, e peeɔ tso nɛ klee pe tsohi kulaa. Nɛ e jeɔ kɔnihi gagaaga nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ba peeɔ tsu ngɛ mi nɛ a naa hi he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Abɛhi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ a mi nɛ Yesu tuɔ munyu ngɛ kɛ tsɔɔ ni ɔmɛ ni bɔ nɛ a maa nu sisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />He nɛ ma kpe ngɛ ɔ, abɛ mi pɛ e tuɔ munyu ngɛ, se ke e piɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ sɔuu ɔ, e jeɔ abɛ ɔmɛ a sisi haa mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ligbi ɔ benɛ du bu ɔ, Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke a ho wo ɔ se ya. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a je ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɔ lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi ɔ. Nɛ lɛ tsɔwi kpa komɛ fie a se. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Se benɛ a yaa ngɛ wo ɔ nɔ saii pɛ nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngua ko te. Kɔɔhiɔ ɔ bɔni nyu fiami kɛ lɛ ɔ mi womi nɛ lɛ ɔ maa ho mumi ya. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu hwɔɔ si nɛ e ngɔ e yi ngɔ fa sɔnue nɔ ngɛ lɛ ɔ se je blɔ nɛ e hwɔ mahe pɔpɔɔpɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ wo tsui pomi kɛ he hiami ya tsiɛ lɛ nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, nɛ lɛ ɔ maa ho mumi ya nɛ ɔ nɛɛ, e pee we mo kɔmɔ ko kulaa lo?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Nɛ Yesu te si nɛ e nga kɔɔhiɔ ɔ yi, nɛ e de wo ɔ ke, “Moo ngmɛ!” Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, kɔɔhiɔ ɔ jɔɔ fiami, nɛ wo ɔ ngmɛ dii.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Nɛ e bi e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ye gbeye kikɛ ɔ? Anɛ nyɛ na we hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ ye mi kɛ sa lo?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kpaloko ji gbeye nu mɛ pe kekle ɔ, nɛ a bɔni a si bi bimi ke, “Nɔmlɔ mimi te nɛ ji enɛ ɔ, nɛ wo kɛ kɔɔhiɔ tete buɔ lɛ tue nɛ ɔ nɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mumi yayami ɔmɛ ya se kpotoo ɔmɛ a mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a pue nɔ kɛ ya su Galilea Wo ɔ nya ngɛ Gerase bi ɔmɛ a zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Si nɛ lɛ ɔ ke e saa nɔuu nɛ Yesu ngɛ si kplee ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu ko nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi nɛ na lɛ ngɛ pa a nɔ lokoo ɔ wo fo kɛ je gɔ ɔ mi nɛ e kɛ lɛ ba kpe.<verse eid="MRK 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Nyumu nɛ ɔ godo ɔ nya wa saminya, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e hi we mi; gɔ mi ngɛ yɔkɔ ɔmɛ a kpɛti ji he nɛ e hii nɛ nɔ ko nyɛ we lɛ nɛ e nu. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ke nine su e nɔ nɛ a bɔ lɛ pã nɛ a wo kɔsɔkɔsɔ titi kɛ wo lɛ po hu ɔ, e nyɛɔ nɛ e tsitslɔ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔ mi nɛ e tsɔɔ pã a kɛkɛ e je. Nɔ ko nɔ ko be nɛ ngɛ he wami kɛ lɛ sɔ nɛ ma nyɛ lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Nɛ nyɔ kɛ pia a, e hii ngmlaa kpae ngɛ gɔ ɔ mi kɛ yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ e woɔ tɛ ke hii e he poe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Benɛ Yesu ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi kɛ ma ngɛ lokoo nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ na lɛ, nɛ e tu fo ba nɔ si ngɛ e hlami.<verse eid="MRK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Nɛ e kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Mɛni peemi i kɛ mo ngɛ, mo Yesu hiɔwe lokoo Mawu ɔ Bi? I na Mawu kaa o ko pee mi nɔ yeyee ko!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />E de enɛ ɔ, ejakaa benɛ e maa ho Yesu ngɔ sumi ya pɛ nɛ Yesu nga mumi yayami ɔ yi nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mumi yayami, jee kpo ngɛ e mi!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Nɛ Yesu bi nɔ ɔ ke, “Kɛ a tsɛɛ mo kɛɛ?” Nyumu ɔ ha heto nɛ e de Yesu ke, “A tsɛɛ mi ke Asafo, ejakaa wa he hiɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Nɛ a kpa Yesu pee ke e ko fie mɛ kɛ je kpo ɔ mi lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Se jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ kpotoo komɛ ngɛ ni yee ngɛ yoku ɔ he ngɛ pa a nya. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Nɛ mumi yayami ɔmɛ kpa Yesu pee ke e ha nɛ a ya sɛ kpotoo ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Nɛ Yesu ha mumi yayami ɔmɛ blɔ nɛ a hia kɛ je nyumu ɔ mi kɛ ya sɛ kpotoo ɔmɛ a mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ kpotoo maa pee akpe enyɔ ɔ kulaa wo fo kɛ ya sɛ pa a mi nɛ a hɛ mi kpata.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Benɛ kpotoo kpakali ɔmɛ na enɛ ɔ, a tu fo kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya bɔ amaniɛ ngɛ kɔpe ɔmɛ tsuo a mi. Nihi bu kɛ je ma a mi kɛ ba nɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ba hyɛ kɛ a hɛ ngmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />A na nyumu ɔ kaa e hɛ mi tɛ nɛ e bu bo kɛ hii si kpoo. Nɛ a ye gbeye. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Nihi nɛ na nɔ́ nɛ ba a ngwɔhe ɔ, bɔ nihi nɛ je ma a mi kɛ ba a bɔ nɛ nɔ́ ɔ plɛ kɛ ba ha. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Se benɛ ma mi bi ɔmɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔ, a ye Yesu gbeye saminya nɛ a kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e je a ma a mi. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Benɛ Yesu kpale ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi sɛe konɛ e je ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ nɛ e hɛ mi tɛ ɔ kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e kɛ lɛ maa ya. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Se Yesu kplɛɛ we lɛ. E de lɛ ke, “Moo ho o we mi ya ngɛ o wekuli a ngɔ, konɛ o ya bɔ mɛ nyakpɛ níhi kulaa nɛ Mawu tsu ha mo ɔ kɛ dloomi nɛ e dloo mo ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Nyumu ɔ ho nɛ e ya fiɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu tsu ha lɛ ɔ ngɛ Ma Nyɔngma amɛ tsuo a mi; nɛ munyu ɔ pee nihi kulaa nɛ nu ɔ nyakpɛ saminya.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakpɛ tsamihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Benɛ Yesu wo lɛ kɛ po pa a kɛ ba e se ɔ, nihi fuu ba bua wo e he ngɛ pa a nya.<verse eid="MRK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />E ngɛ pa a nya nɔuu nɛ lejɛ ɔ kpe he ɔ nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ le ke Yairo ɔ hu ba lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ba kpla si ngɛ e nane nya. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />E kpa Yesu pɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Ye biyo be he wami kulaa, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji kaa gbenɔ muɔ nya nɛ e fɔɔ si ngɛ. I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o ba nɛ o ba wo o nine kɛ ta e he nɛ e na he wami.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Benɛ Yesu nyɛɛ Yairo se kɛ yaa e we ɔ mi ɔ, nihi fuu bu fie e se. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Yo ko hu ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ be he wami. Muɔ ngɛ bee ngɛ e he jeha nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ sɔuu ji nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />E kpa tsopatsɛmɛ slɔɔtohi a nɔ, nɛ e puɛ e sika kulaa ta se hiɔ ɔ jɔɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />E nu nyakpɛ níhi nɛ Yesu tsu ɔmɛ a he, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, lɛ hu e nyɛɛ e se nɛ e ya pɛtɛ Yesu tade ɔ he.<verse eid="MRK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ejakaa e susu nɛ e de ke, “Ke i ta e tade ɔ nya he kɛkɛ i ma na he wami.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Anɔkuale mi ɔ, Yesu tade ɔ he nɛ e ke e taa nɔuu pɛ nɛ muɔ ɔ jɔɔ bemi ngɛ e he, nɛ e nu he kaa e na he wami.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu nu he ngɛ e mi jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu kaa tsami he wami ko je e mi. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e plɛ nɛ e bi ke, “Mɛnɔ ta ye he ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />E kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, mo nitsɛ o ngɛ hyɛe kaa ni ɔmɛ hiɛ nɛ a ngɛ mo fifie. Kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ o biɔ ke mɛnɔ ta o he kɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Se Yesu ngɛ e he poe kɛ sa kaa e maa na nɔ nɛ ta e he ɔ lo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Nɛ benɛ yo ɔ na nɔ́ nɛ a tsu ha lɛ ɔ, e wo gbeye kɛ he kpokpomi kɛ ya kpla si ngɛ e hlami nɛ e de lɛ anɔkuale ɔ kulaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Nɛ Yesu de yo ɔ ke, “Biyo, o hemi kɛ yemi tsa mo; moo ya ngɛ he jɔmi mi, nɛ o hiɔ ɔ nɛ jɔ ha mo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Benɛ Yesu kɛ yo ɔ ngɛ munyu tue nɔuu ɔ, tsɔli je Yairo we ɔ mi kɛ ba ba de lɛ ke, “O biyo ɔ hiɔ ɔ puɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mo ko hao tsɔɔlɔ ɔ hu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Se Yesu ngɔɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ a munyu ɔ. E plɛ nɛ e de Yairo ke, “Koo ye gbeye. Moo lɛɛ mo na hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ ye mi kɛkɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e ha nɛ asafo ɔ ho da si nɛ e tsɛ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane kɛ piɛ e he nɛ e kɛ mɛ ho Yairo we ɔ mi ya. E ha we he blɔ nɛ nɔ kpa ko nɛ e nyɛɛ a se. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Benɛ a ya su ɔ, Yesu na kaa nihi fuu ba bua a he nya ngɛ ya foe nɛ lejɛ ɔ pee basabasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />E sɛ we ɔ mi nɛ e bi ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ya foe nɛ nyɛ ha hiɛ ɔ pee hoo kikɛ ɔ? Mahe kɛkɛ nɛ jokuɛ ɔ hwɔ, e gbo we!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Se ni ɔmɛ muɔ lɛ saminya. Kɛkɛ nɛ e ha nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ je kpo kɛ je tsu ɔ mi nɛ e kɛ binyɛ kɛ bitsɛ ɔ kɛ e kaseli etɛ ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ e he ɔ sɛ tsu ɔ mi he nɛ jokuɛ ɔ hwɔɔ si ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu ya su sa a he nɛ e nu jokuɛ ɔ nine si nɛ e de ke, “Talita kuumi!” E sisi ji, “Biyo, moo te si!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Yesu nya nɔɛ si nɛ jokuɛ yo nɛ ye jeha nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔ te si da si nɛ e bɔni nyɛɛmi. Ni ɔmɛ a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a ye gbeye. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu de mɛ veveeve ke a ko de nɔ ko nɔ́ nɛ e pee nɛ ɔ kulaa. Nɛ e de fɔli ɔmɛ ke a ha a bi ɔ nɔ́ ko nɛ e ye.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Nɛ e je lejɛ ɔ, e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ je kɛ ho lɛ nitsɛ e ma nɛ ji Nazaret ɔ ya. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />E ya kpe he ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ nɛ e ya tsɔɔ ni. Nihi nɛ bu e ni tsɔɔmi ɔ tue ɔ, a na kaa e nile mi kuɔ. Enɛ ɔ pee mɛ nyakpɛ nɛ a bi ke, “Jije Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ ya kase ni ngɛ? Nɛ jije nɛ e na nile kaa kikɛ ɔ kɛ je? Nyakpɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ hu nɛ e ngɛ pee ɔ nɛɛ, jije a je?<verse eid="MRK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Anɛ tsa pi kapitɛ ɔ kɛ Maria a bi ɔ, Yakobo kɛ Yosef kɛ Yuda kɛ Simon a nyɛminyumu ɔ ji nɛ ɔ lo? Nɔ nɛ e nyɛmimɛ yihi ngɛ wa kpɛti ngɛ wa ma nɛ ɔ mi ɔ lo?” Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ́ ɔ pee mɛ tai.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nɛ, gbalɔ he be bumi ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ma mi kɛ e wekuli kɛ e nyɛmimɛ a kpɛti, se a buu lɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Nɛ akɛnɛ a he we yi he je ɔ, Yesu nyɛ we nyakpɛ ni nguahi nɛ e tsu ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Nɔ nɛ kɛkɛ nɛ e pee ji, e wo e nine ngɔ pue hiɔtsɛ bɔɔ komɛ kɛkɛ a nɔ nɛ e tsa mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Nɛ e pee lɛ nyakpɛ kaa ni ɔmɛ he we lɛ yi. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e si ma a mi nɛ e bɔni kɔpe ɔmɛ kpami ngɛ ni tsɔɔe. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Nɛ e tsɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ e tsɔ mɛ ni enyɔɔnyɔ nɛ e ha mɛ he wami nɛ a ma kɛ hia mumi yayamihi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />E de mɛ ke, nɛ a yaa nɛ ɔ, a hɛɛ dɛma tso, se a ko de ke a maa hɛɛ niye ni loo kotoku loo sika. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Nɛ a ko hɛɛ tade loo tokota hu kɛ piɛ nɔ́ nɛ a wo ɔ he.<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />E tsa nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ke nyɛ ya su ma ko mi ɔ, nyɛɛ to we kake pɛ mi kɛ ya si be nɛ nyɛ maa je jamɛ a ma a mi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Se ke nyɛ na kaa ma a mi bi ɔmɛ sume nɛ a nu munyu nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ je kɛ ho he kpa ya. Se mohu, ke nyɛ ma si ma a mi ɔ, nyɛ blɛ nyɛ nane si zu ngɔ pue ma a nɔ kaa okadi ngɛ hwɔɔ se he.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ma blɔ nɛ a bɔni Munyu ɔ fiɛmi ngɛ ni ɔmɛ dee ke a tsake a tsui. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Nɛ a hiaa mumi yayamihi ngɛ nihi fuu a mi nɛ a pɔ hiɔtsɛmɛ nu nɛ a tsa mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ gbenɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />E kɛ we nɛ Matsɛ Herode nu Yesu he, ejakaa e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ ha nɛ e he sane kpe zugba a nɔ tsuo. E je nihi a nya nɛ a de ke, “Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ pɛ nɛ e kpale ba blaa nɛ ɔ nɛ; nɛ enɛ ɔ he je nɛ e nyɛ nyakpɛ ni slɔɔto nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ tsue ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ni komɛ hu de ke Elia, blema gbalɔ ɔ nɛ kpale kɛ ba wami mi ekohu. Se nihi hu de ke, gbalɔ he kaa blema gbali ngua amɛ a ti nɔ ko i. <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Se Matsɛ Herode de ke, “Dabi! Yohane Baptisilɔ nɛ i ha a po e yi ɔ, lɛ nɛ e kpale te si ekohu ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ejakaa Herode nɛ e ha a nu Yohane ngɔ wo tsu mi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ejakaa Herode ya wo e nyɛmi Filipo yo Herodia nɛ e ngɔ.Nɛ Yohane ka Herode hɛ mi ngɛ he, nɛ e de lɛ ke e dɛ blɔ kaa e ngɔɔ e senɔ yo ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Herodia sume Yohane sane nɛ e ko na nɛ a gbe lɛ se e na we e he blɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Se akɛnɛ Herode yee Yohane gbeye, ejakaa e buu lɛ Mawu Nɔmlɔ he je ɔ, e kɛ lɛ ya to kɛkɛ. Yohane munyu ɔmɛ haoɔ Herode juɛmi, se loloolo ɔ, e suɔ kaa e maa bu lɛ tue.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />E ba mi kaa Herode ngɛ e fɔmi ligbi yee nɛ e tsɛ okplɔɔ nɛ e kpee e he buli kɛ e tatsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ Galilea nikɔtɔma amɛ kulaa. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nɛ benɛ a ba kpe nɛ a ngɛ ni ɔ yee ɔ, Herodia biyo ɔ ba do kɛ je ni ɔmɛ a hɛ ja, nɛ e do ɔ muɔ Herode kɛ ni ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ ba kpe ɔ a hɛ mi saminya. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, matsɛ ɔ de jokuɛ yo ɔ ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ke, “Mo bi mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o suɔ, nɛ i ma ha mo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Nɛ e ka lɛ kita ke, “Ke ye matsɛ ma nɛ fɔɔ si nɛ ɔ e mi dlami fiee po i jio, i ma ha mo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yoyo ɔ ho nɛ e ya bɔ e nyɛ Herodia amaniɛ nɛ e bi e nyɛ ɔ nɔ́ nɛ e ma bi matsɛ ɔ. E nyɛ ɔ ha lɛ heto ke, “Mo ya bi lɛ ke o ngɛ Yohane yi hlae.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Yoyo ɔ kpale amlɔ ɔ nɔuu kɛ ho nɛ e ya de matsɛ ɔ ke, “I suɔ nɛ o po Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ yi nɛ o kɛ fɔ suwe nɔ ha mi nɔuu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Sane ɔ he wa ha matsɛ ɔ saminya, se kaa e ka kita ngɛ nihi nɛ e kpee kɛ ba a tsuo a hɛ mi he je ɔ, e nyɛ we nɛ e kua. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ matsɛ ɔ fa e he buli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ke e ya tsu ɔ mi nɛ e ya po Yohane yi ke ba ha lɛ. Kɛkɛ nɛ soja a ho nɛ e ya gbe Yohane ngɛ tsu ɔ mi. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Nɛ e wo yi ɔ kɛ fo suwe nɔ kɛ ba ha yoyo ɔ nɛ yoyo ɔ hu wo kɛ ya ha e nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Benɛ Yohane kaseli ɔmɛ nu munyu ɔ he ɔ, a ba nɛ a ba wo gbogboe ɔ kɛ ho nɛ a ya pu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha nihi akpe enuɔ ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Benɛ Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ kpale kɛ ba a, a ba bɔ lɛ a tsɔmi ɔ mi amaniɛ, nɛ a de lɛ ni nɛ a ya tsu kɛ ni nɛ a ya tsɔɔ ni ɔmɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Nɛ Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ waa ho he ko banee ya nɛ nyɛ ya jɔɔ nyɛ he bɔɔ.” Ejakaa nihi fuu ngɛ a ngɔ bae he je ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ na we deka nɛ a ma kɛ wo a nya mi nɔ ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a ya sɛ lɛ mi nɛ a gbla a he si bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Se nihi fuu na mɛ be mi nɛ a sɛ lɛ ɔ mi ɔ, nɛ a je kɔpe ɔmɛ a mi nɛ a nyɛɛ nane kɛ fie a se mlamlaamla kɛ ya po mɛ, nɛ a ya su pa a se loko e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ya su. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ e je kpo ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi ɔ, nihi fuu ba su lejɛ ɔ momo; nɛ benɛ e na mɛ ɔ, a ni pee lɛ mɔbɔ. Ejakaa a ngɛ kaa tohi nɛ be kpakalɔ. Nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ níhi fuu nɛ sa kaa a le.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Maa pee gbɔkuɛ he ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ a ba de lɛ ke, “Du maa ho bumi ya, nɛ hiɛ ɔ kɛ ma a mi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Ja a he je ɔ, moo wo ni ɔmɛ blɔ nɛ a ho kɔpekɔpe ɔmɛ kɛ ngmɔ si ɔmɛ ya nɛ a ya hla nɔ́ ko nɛ a ye, ejakaa niye ni ko be hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ha mɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ a ye.” A ha lɛ heto nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni wa ma ha mɛ lo? Anɛ wa ma nyɛ nimli nɛ pueɔ si nɛ ɔ a nya ngma ma he piɔ? Ku sidi lafa enyɔ hu tsa be mɛ sue!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Abolo nyɛmɛ ngɛ nyɛ dɛ? Nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya hyɛ ha.” A ya nɛ a kpale kɛ ba de lɛ ke a ngɛ abolo kakaaka enuɔ kɛ lo tsɔwi enyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Nɛ Yesu de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ ni ɔmɛ a bua a he nya kuuhikuuhi kɛ hi si ngɛ nga a nɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ha ni ɔmɛ hi si nyingmi enuɔɔnuɔ kɛ lafalafa.<verse eid="MRK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Benɛ ni ɔmɛ hi si ta a, Yesu wo abolo enuɔ ɔ kɛ lo tsɔwi enyɔ ɔ. E wo e hɛ mi nɔ nɛ e hyɛ hiɔwe, nɛ e jɔɔ nɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ, e poo mi nɛ e wo ngɔ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ a dla kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ. Ja a kɛ e ngɔ lo enyɔ ɔmɛ hu kɛ ha mɛ nɛ a dla. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Niye ni ɔ su nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ye nɛ a tɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Nɛ a kukuɔ niye ni ɔ sisi bibliwi nɛ e hyi kusii agboagbo nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nyumuhi nɛ ye ni ɔ a hiɛmi ji akpe enuɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />A ye ni ɔ ta pɛ nɛ Yesu wo e kaseli ɔmɛ blɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke a sɛ lɛ ɔ nɛ a sɛ e hlami kɛ ho Betsaida ya ngɛ pa a se, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ ɔ lɛɛ e maa wo ni ɔmɛ blɔ loko ji e maa fie a se.<verse eid="MRK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Benɛ e kɛ ni ɔmɛ ye sɛ se ɔ, e ho yoku ɔ nɔ ya nɛ e ya sɔle. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nyɔ mi be mi ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ ya su pa a kpɛti; se jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yesu lɛɛ e ngɛ kpo ɔ nɔ ngɛ pa a se kɛ sa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />E na kaa kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ kɔɔhiɔ kpee wawɛɛ nɛ pɔ ngɛ a he tɔe kɛ lɛ ɔ hluimi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e fie a se, maa pee makɛ ngmlɛ etɛ mi, nɛ e ngɛ nyu ɔ nɔ nyɛɛe. Se benɛ e maa ho a he bemi ya a, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />a na lɛ nɛ a tsui po nɛ a kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ, ejakaa a susu kaa kpade i. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Se amlɔ ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ tsui nɛ ko po. Ami i!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ya sɛ lɛ ɔ mi, nɛ nɔuu ɔ, kɔɔhiɔ ɔ kpa a nya doomi. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a nya kpɛ a he saminya. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />A yɔse we nɔ nɛ e ji ngɛ abolo sane ɔ se tete, ejakaa a tsui wa. <verse eid="MRK 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />A tsa nɔ nɛ a ya sa si ngɛ Genesaret pa a nya nɛ a muɔ lɛ ɔ si. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Se kpo nɛ e je pɛ nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ yo lɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />nɛ nɔuu ɔ, a gbɛ e he sane kɛ fia nɛ nihi bɔni a hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ womi kɛ e ngɔ bami. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Nɛ he tsuaa he nɛ e ya a, ngmɔ si kɔpe ɔmɛ kɛ ma tsɔwi ɔmɛ kɛ ma ngua amɛ a mi ɔ, a woɔ hiɔtsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ baa gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ kɛ jua amɛ a nɔ nɛ a kpaa lɛ pɛɛ kaa e ha mɛ he blɔ nɛ a ta e tade ɔ he kɛkɛ. Nɛ hiɔtsɛ tsuaa hiɔtsɛ nɛ na he blɔ ta e tade ɔ he ɔ, e naa he wami.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ ya ta Yesu nya mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa leli komɛ je Yerusalem kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />A to he hɛ kaa Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔ nɔ tɔe, ejakaa a fɔ we a dɛ loko a yeɔ ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />E ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi kaa ja Yuda no fɔ e dɛ loko e ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e maa po ni kɛ wo e nya mi. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Nɛ be saa be nɛ Yuda no maa je ma loo jua mi kɛ ba we mi ɔ, ja e fɔ e he loko e maa ta niye ni he. Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ kusumi kpa komɛ hu nɛ kɔɔ a ni peemihi a he, nɛ ekomɛ ji kusumi nɛ kɔɔ nyu numi níhi kɛ tsesihi kɛ kahi kɛ buɛhi a he fɔmi he.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa leli ɔmɛ bi Yesu ke, “Kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ o kaseli ɔmɛ yi blema kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ a woɔ a gu ninehi nɛ a fɔ we he ɔ kɛ yeɔ ni kɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Gbalɔ Yesaia tɛ ji enɛ. Ejakaa blema lokoo nɛ a je nyɛ osato peemi nɛ ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ nɛ e gba ngɛ nyɛ he nɛ e de ke, ‘Yaka tsuaa nɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ ke a ngɛ mi jae; a nya gu nɛ a kɛ ngɛ dee, ejakaa nɔ nɛ a ngɛ pee ɔ, e ji a tsui mi fɛɛ; a tsui be he. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />A wo nimli a blɔ nya tomi kɛ nile ngɔ fɔ si nɛ a ngɛ mɛ tsɛe ke Mawu mlaahi.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nyɛ si Mawu mlaa amɛ a se nɛ nyɛ pɛtɛ nimli a blɔ nya tomi kɛ nile he wawɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ke nyɛ ngɛ Mawu mlaahi a nɔ yee. <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Nyɛ kua Mawu mlaa amɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ blema kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ yee.<verse eid="MRK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mose de nyɛ ke, ‘Moo bu o tsɛ kɛ o nyɛ.’ Nɛ e de nyɛ hu ke, ‘Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ e nya nɔ ngɛ e tsɛ loo e nyɛ nɔ ɔ, a gbe lɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ de ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e deɔ e tsɛ loo e nyɛ ke, ‘Maa loo Tsaatsɛ, nɔ nɛ jinɛ i ko ha mo ɔ, i wo kɛ ya ha Mawu, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i be nyɛe ma ye kɛ bua mo.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, nyɛ ha we lɛ he blɔ nɛ e hyɛɔ e fɔli hu, aloo nɛ e peeɔ nɔ ko kɛ haa mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nɛ nyɛ wo nyɛ blema kusumi ɔmɛ kɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ blɔ nya tomihi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ba ye Mawu Munyu ɔ nane mi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ ni ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ bu nɔ́ nɛ i ma de nɛ ɔ tue saminya nɛ nyɛɛ nu sisi! <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nɔ́ ko be nɛ jee kpo nɔ blɔ kɛ sɛɔ nɔmlɔ mi nɛ e woɔ nɔmlɔ he mu. Se níhi nɛ jee Nɔmlɔ nitsɛ mi ɔmɛ ji níhi nɛ woɔ e he mu. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ke nyɛ ngɛ tue ɔ, nyɛɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ saminya.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Pee se benɛ e ba we mi nɛ e piɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ pɛ ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ abɛ ɔ nɛ e bu ɔ sisi.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ nui sisi lo? Nyɛ li kaa nɔ́ ko be nɛ sɛɔ nɔ mi kɛ jee kpo nɔ blɔ nɛ e woɔ nɔ ɔ he mu, ejakaa e sɛ we e tsui mi lo? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ke nɔ ko ye nɔ́ ko kɛ gu e nya mi ɔ nɛɛ tsa pi e muklii mi nɛ e ya sɛɔ, nɛ be bɔɔ se ɔ e ya jeɔ ngɔ pueɔ si lo?”<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />E ya nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ jee nɔmlɔ tsui kɛ e susumi mi ɔ woɔ nɔmlɔ he mu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ejakaa nɔmlɔ tsui kɛ e juɛmi mi nɔ́ susumi kɛ ni yayamihi kulaa jee, níhi kaa gba puɛmi, ajuama bɔmi, nɔ gbemi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />jumi, hɛ kɔmi, je mi yaya bami, sisimi, ko bɔmi, ninyɛ, hɛ mi saami, musu bɔmi, he womi, tue kpɛkpɛɛ sane yemi kɛ ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ subai yaya slɔɔto kpa amɛ kulaa a, nɔmlɔ tsui kɛ e susumi mi nɛ a puɛɛ kɛ jee; nɛ mɛ ji nihi nɛ woɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he mu ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsu nyakpɛ nihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu je lejɛ ɔ kɛ ho Tiro kɛ Zidon ni ɔmɛ a mi ya. E ya sɛ we ko mi nɛ jinɛ e to nɛ e maa laa e he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ bɔɔ nɛ e jɔɔ e he, se e nyɛ we. Ejakaa e he sane gbɛ fia lejɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ a nu he kaa e ngɛ jamɛ a we ɔ mi.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yo ko nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ nɔ́ dee ha e biyo ɔ nu e he nɛ e wo fo kɛ ba kpla si ngɛ e nane nya. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nɛ e ba kpa Yesu pɛɛ ke e hia mumi yayami ɔ ngɛ e biyo ɔ mi. Se yo nɛ ɔ ma je nɔ i, nɛ he nɛ e je ji Fonisia ngɛ Siria zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Se Yesu de lɛ ke, “Mo ha nɛ ma ye kɛ bua ye wekuli Yuda bi ɔmɛ lolo. Ejakaa e sɛ kaa niye ni nɛ ji bi ɔmɛ a nɔ́ ɔ, a sakee ke fɔɔ he haa gbehi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Nɛ yo ɔ hu ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, munyu ngwɔhe nɛ o tu ɔ nɛ; se mohu ji niye ni bibliwi nɛ jee bi ɔmɛ a okplɔɔ nɔ kɛ pueɔ si ɔ, gbe bi ɔmɛ ngɛ okplɔɔ ɔ sisi ɔ hu yeɔ faa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu ha yo ɔ heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ngɛ munyu nɛ o tu nɛ ɔ he je ɔ, moo kpale kɛ ho we mi ya; mumi yayami ɔ je o bi ɔ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Niinɛ, benɛ yo ɔ kpale ya su we ɔ mi ɔ, e ya na e biyo ɔ nɛ e hwɔɔ si ngɛ sa nɔ nɛ mumi yayami ɔ je e mi nɛ e hɛ mi tɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu kpale kɛ je Tiro kɛ ya gu Zidon kɛ Dekapoli nɔ́ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ba Galilea Wo ɔ nya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Benɛ e ya su lejɛ ɔ, a wo tue kpokutsɛ ko nɛ mumui hu ji lɛ ɔ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ a ba kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e wo e nine ngɔ fɔ e nɔ nɛ e tsa lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu wo hiɔtsɛ ɔ kɛ ya se bɔɔ nɛ e wo e nine nguɛhi kɛ hɔ e tue puɔhi a mi nɛ e su lada nɛ e ngɔ kɛ sa hiɔtsɛ ɔ lilɛ nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Nɛ e wo e hɛ mi nɔ nɛ e hyɛ hiɔwe, nɛ e hao ngɛ e mumi mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e nga nɛ e de ke, “Hefata!” E sisi ji, “Mo bli!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, nyumu ɔ tue bli nɛ e lilɛ hu pine nɛ e tu munyu paa.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu wo ni ɔmɛ si veveeve ke a ko de nɛ nɔ ko nɛ nu. Se kpaloko mohu a nya wa he nɛ a fiɛ munyu nɛ ɔ kɛ kpe kpo ɔ mi tsuo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ejakaa a nya kpɛ a he kɛ be nɔ. Nɛ a de ke, “Nyakpɛ nɔ́ sɔuu e ngɛ tsue! E ha nɛ tue kpokutsɛ ngɛ nɔ nue, nɛ mumuihi hu ngɛ munyu tue.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ligbi ko maa pee be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ɔ, Yesu to he hɛ kaa asafo nɛ ba bua ekohu ngɛ lɛ tue bue ɔ, hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee. Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a ni ngɛ mi mɔbɔ pee. Ejakaa ligbi etɛ sɔuu ji nɛ ɔ nɛ a ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ a wui a nya mi nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nɛ ke i wo mɛ blɔ ke a ho we mi ya kɛ muklii mi gu ɔ, klibi ma ya po a ti ni komɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ, ejakaa a je he kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ ha lɛ heto nɛ a bi ke, “Jije wa ma na niye ni ngɛ ngɛ nga nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ maa tɔ nimli asafo nɛ pueɔ si nɛ ɔ lo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ekohu ke, “Abolo nyɛmɛ ngɛ nyɛ dɛ?” Nɛ a ha lɛ heto ke, “Kpaago.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de ni ɔmɛ ke a hi si ngɛ zugba. Jehanɛ ɔ e wo abolo kpaago ɔ nɛ benɛ e na Mawu si ngɛ he se ɔ, e ku abolo ɔmɛ a mi nɛ e ngɔ kɛ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ ke a dla kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ. Nɛ a dla kɛ ha mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />A ngɛ lo tsɔwi komɛ hulɔ. Yesu jɔɔ lɔ ɔ hu nɔ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke a dla lo ɔ hu kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Nɛ asafo babauu ɔ tsuo ye ni ɔ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ tɔ; nɛ bibliwi nɛ pue si nɛ a kukuɔ ɔ hyi kusii nguanguaanguahi kpaago. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Nihi nɛ ye ni ɔ a hiɛmi maa pee akpe eywiɛ. Nɛ niye ni ɔ se ɔ, e wo mɛ blɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛni okadi kpa nyɛ ngɛ hlae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔuu nɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ hu sɛ lɛ kɛ ho Dalmanuta ni ɔmɛ a mi ya. <verse eid="MRK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Benɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ nu he kaa e ba a, a ba e ngɔ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ba sa nya; nɛ a ka lɛ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Moo pee hiɔwe okadi ko ngɔ tsɔɔ wɔ nɛ waa hyɛ konɛ waa na kaa Mawu Nɔmlɔ ji mo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Benɛ Yesu nu enɛ ɔ, e hao ngɛ e mumi mi nɛ e bi ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ yi nɔ nɛ ɔ bimɛ ngɛ okadi hlae? Anɔkuale ji kaa a be okadi kpa ko pee hu kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kpale sɛ lɛ ɔ mi amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e si mɛ kɛ ho pa a se ya. <verse eid="MRK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ a hɛ je nɔ nɛ a hɛɛ we abolo kɛ to dɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ abolo kake too pɛ nɛ piɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi ha mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Benɛ a ngɛ pa a nɔ kɛ yaa a, Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he nɛ hi ngɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ Matsɛ Herode a ma sasɛ ɔ he!”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />E kaseli ɔmɛ susu kaa abolo nɛ a hɛɛ we ɔ he munyu nɛ Yesu ngɛ tue.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu na le nɔ́ he nɛ a ngɛ sɛsɛɛ ɔ nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ susue kaa abolo nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ we ɔ he munyu i ngɛ tue? Nyɛ kɔ we nɔ́ se lolo? Anɛ nyɛ juɛmi nya de ma lo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Kɛ pee kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hɛ ngmɛ se nyɛ hyɛ we ní; nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tue hu se nyɛ nui nɔ́ ɔ? Pe nyɛ hɛ je nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɔ mo?<verse eid="MRK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Benɛ i ku abolo enuɔ mi ngɔ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ dla kɛ ha nihi akpe enuɔ ɔ, bibliwi nɛ nyɛ kukuɔ ɔ, kusii nyɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ na?” A ha lɛ heto ke nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Nɛ benɛ i ku abolo kpaago kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛ dla ngɔ ha nihi akpe eywiɛ ɔ nɛɛ, nyɛmɛ piɛ?” A ha heto ke, “Bibliwi kusii kpaago.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Kɛ pee kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ nui sisi kɛ sa? Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ susue kaa abolo nɛ wa hɛɛ we ɔ nɛ ngɛ ye juɛmi nya gbae lo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Benɛ a ya su Betsaida a, a wo nɔ ko nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ yu kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ a kpa lɛ pɛɛ ke e wo e nine ngɔ ta e he nɛ e tsa lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu ta hiɔtsɛ ɔ dɛ mi nɛ e kpaka lɛ kɛ je kpo ngɛ ma a mi. Nɛ benɛ e su lada kɛ pue hiɔtsɛ ɔ hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, e wo e nine ngɔ bu a nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “O ngɛ nɔ́ hyɛɛ lo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Nyumu ɔ po he nɛ e de Yesu ke, “Ee, i ngɛ nihi hyɛe, se a pee kaa tohi ngɛ ye hɛ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu wo e nine ngɔ bu e hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ekohu. Hiɔtsɛ ɔ gbɛ e hɛ ngmɛ mi kɛkɛ nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ bli nɛ e bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi paa. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Nɛ Yesu wo lɛ blɔ ke e ho e we mi ya ngɛ e wekuli a ngɔ. Nɛ e bɔ lɛ kɔkɔ ke, “Mo ko de ke o ngɛ kpalee kɛ yaa kɔpe ɔ mi kekle!”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ si Galilea kɛ ho ma tsɔwi nɛ bɔle Kaisaria Filipi ɔ a mi ya. Benɛ a yaa ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e bi e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ ni ɔmɛ deɔ ke i ji? Kɛ a ngɛ dee ngɛ ye he kɛɛ?” A ha lɛ heto ke, <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />“Ni komɛ ke Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ ji mo, ni komɛ hu ke blema gbali ɔmɛ a ti nɔ eko ji mo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Nɛ nyɛ nɛɛ, mɛnɔ tutuutu ji mi nɛ nyɛ le piɔ?” Petro ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Se Yesu wo mɛ si ke a ko de nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e nu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e je sisi nɛ e bɔni e kaseli ɔmɛ amanehlu nɛ maa ba e nɔ kɛ nisɛ ni a ni slɔɔtohi nɛ a maa pee lɛ ɔ demi. Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa na nɔ, nɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo nya dali ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ma kua lɛ; nɛ a ma je e he gbi kɛ ha nɛ a maa gbe lɛ. Se ligbi etɛ se ɔ, e maa te si kɛ je gbeje.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />E de mɛ enɛ ɔ paa, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Petro tsɛ lɛ kɛ ya se nɛ e bɔni e hɛ mi kami ngɛ munyu nɛ e tu ɔ he.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Se Yesu plɛ e hɛ mi kɛ kpee e kaseli ɔmɛ, nɛ e hyɛ mɛ, nɛ e gli kɛ wo Petro nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Moo be kɛ ho ye se ya, Abosiami, nimli a juɛmi nya munyu nɛ o ngɛ mi tue nɛ ɔ nɛ; e slo Mawu yi mi tomi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ ni ɔmɛ kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ke mo nɔ ko o suɔ nɛ o maa nyɛɛ ye se ɔ, lɛɛ o ma kua o he nɛ o wo o sɛumi tso ɔ nɛ o kɛ nyɛɛ ye se. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ susuu kaa e maa baa e klaa yi ɔ, e maa je e dɛ; se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma wo e he kɛ sa afɔle ngɛ ye he loo ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ he ɔ, e ma he lɛ nitsɛ e yi wami.<verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mɛni se nɔmlɔ ma na ke ji kaa e na je nɛ ɔ mi nihi tsuo se e laa e klaa a. <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Anɛ nɔ́ ko ngɛ nɛ he jua wa pe e klaa a lo? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ ami kɛ ye munyu ɔ he peeɔ lɛ zo ngɛ yi nɔ bimɛ yayami peeli nɛ be hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔ a be nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, lɛ hu e he maa pee Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ zo be mi nɛ e maa ba ngɛ e Tsɛ anunyami ɔ mi kɛ e bɔfo klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ngɛ e anunyami mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />E ya nɔ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, nyɛ nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ hiɛ ɔ piɔ nɛ ɔ, nihi ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ a maa na Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ bami ɔ paa loko ji a ma si je mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />E nɔ ligbi ekpa se ɔ, Yesu ngɔ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane nɛ e kɛ mɛ ho yoku ko nɔ ya banee, he nɛ nɔ ko be. A ngɛ lɛ hyɛe nɔuu nɛ si kake too ɔ, e hɛ mi bɔni kpɛmi kɛ anunyami. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nɛ e tade nɛ e wo ɔ plɛ futaa bɔ nɛ nɔ́ ko be zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ ma nyɛ ha e hiɔ ja. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Gbalɔ Elia kɛ Mose ba je kpo nɛ a kɛ Yesu bɔni munyu tumi.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Nɛ Petro de Yesu ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, e hi kaa waa hi hiɛ ɔ. Mo ha nɛ waa ma bo tsuhi etɛ ha nyɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, o nɔ́ kake, Mose nɔ́ kake kɛ Elia hu nɔ́ kake.”<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Se enɛ ɔ nɛ Petro de ɔ, pe e de gu kɛkɛ, ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ a na a ha a tsui po nɛ a li bɔ nɛ a ngɛ pee.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔ kuu ko ba ha mɛ tsuo a nɔ. Nɛ gbi ko de kɛ je bɔ kuu ɔ mi ke, “Ami nitsɛ ye suɔmi Bi ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, nyɛɛ bu lɛ tue.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Se benɛ a po hɛ nɛ a hyɛ ɔ, Mose kɛ Elia laa nɛ e piɛ Yesu nɔ kake too kɛ mɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Benɛ a ngɛ yoku ɔ kplee kɛ ma a, Yesu wo mɛ si ke, “Nyɛ ko de nɔ ko nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ na nɛ ɔ kɛ ya si be nɛ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa te si kɛ je gbeje.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ de we nɛ nɔ kpa ko nɛ nu, nɛ mɛ kɛkɛ a sɛsɛɛ munyu ɔ he ngɛ a kpɛti nɛ a hii a he bie ke, “Si temi kɛ je gbeje nɛ ɔ nɛɛ, kɛ ji e mi tsɔɔmi kɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ deɔ ke ja Gbalɔ Elia sɛ hlami kɛ ba lolo ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Heto nɛ e ha mɛ ji, “Munyu ngwɔhe i; Elia maa sɛ hlami nɛ e ba to nɔ tsuaa nɔ blɔ nɔ lolo. Se mɛni he je nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ke Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ maa na nɔ babauu nɛ a ma kua lɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee faii ke Elia ba mo nɛ a pee lɛ bɔ nɛ a suɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ngɛ e he ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tsa jokuɛ mumi yayamitsɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Benɛ a kpale kɛ ma kaseli nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ɔ, a na kaa nihi fuu ba bu wo a he nɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ekomɛ kɛ mɛ ngɛ munyu he huae. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Benɛ asafo ɔ na Yesu ɔ, a hɛ mi pee mɛ yaa nɛ a wo fo kɛ ya kpee lɛ nɛ a nga lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bi e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Mɛni munyu he nyɛɛ kɛ ni ɔmɛ ngɛ huae ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nɔ ko ha heto ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e de ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, i wo ye binyumu nɛ ɔ kɛ ba nɛ o tsa lɛ ha mi, ejakaa mumi yayami ngɛ nɔ dee ha lɛ nɛ e nyɛ we munyu nɛ e tu. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Nɛ ke benɛ mumi ɔ klã a, e poo lɛ kɛ fɔɔ si ngɛ zugba, kɛkɛ ɔ e nya mi fiaa hwɔli nɛ e hii e lungu kpee nɛ lɛ nɔmlɔ ɔ tsuo e wluaa gaganii. I kpa o kaseli ɔmɛ pɛɛ nɛ a hia mumi yayami ɔ kɛ je ye bi ɔ mi ha mi se a nyɛ we.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu bi e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi hiɛ́ kulaa kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni be kulaa e sa kaa i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si kɛ ya si loko ji nyɛ ma na hemi kɛ yemi? Nɛ mɛni be ma na tsui ha nyɛ kɛ ya si? Nyɛ wo nyumuyo ɔ kɛ ba ha mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />A kpaka lɛ kɛ ba Yesu ngɔ. Nɛ benɛ mumi ɔ na Yesu pɛ kɛkɛ nɛ e po jokuɛ ɔ ngɔ fɔ si nɛ e ha nɛ e bɔni kunemi ngɛ zugba nɛ e nya mi bɔni hwɔli fiami.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bi e tsɛ ɔ ke, “Be nyɛmɛ ji nɛ nɛ mumi yayami ɔ bɔni nɔ demi ha lɛ?” E ha lɛ heto ke, “Kɛ je e jokuɛ si; <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />nɛ behi fuu ɔ, mumi yayami ɔ ya poo lɛ kɛ fɔɔ la loo nyu mi, ejakaa e ngɛ hlae nɛ e gbe lɛ. Moo na wɔ mɔbɔ nɛ o pee he nɔ ko ha wɔ ke ji o ma nyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “O ke ke i ma nyɛ lo? Ke o ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ, o ma nyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ maa pee.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />E nya nɔɛ si nɛ jokuɛ ɔ tsɛ ɔ hia ngmlaa kɛ de ke, “I heɔ yeɔ. Moo piɛ ye hemi kɛ yemi nɛ pi ɔ he ha mi!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Benɛ Yesu na kaa ni ɔmɛ ba ngɛ buae fuu tsɔ ɔ, e nga mumi yayami ɔ yi nɛ e de ke, “Mo tue kpoku kɛ mumui mumi yayami, i ngɛ mo fae kaa o je kpo ngɛ nyumuyo nɛ ɔ mi nɛ o ko kpale kɛ ba sɛ e mi hu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mumi ɔ kpa ngmlaa nɛ e po jokuɛ ɔ ngɔ fɔ si nɛ e hoso lɛ wawɛɛ loko ji e je e mi. Jokuɛ ɔ pee kaa nɔ nɛ gbo; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ke e gbo. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Se Yesu nu e kɔni si nɛ e wo e nɔ kɛ da si nɛ e na he wami. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Benɛ Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ho we ɔ mi ya nɛ e piɛ mɛ sɔuu ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he je loko ji wɔɔ lɛɛ wa nyɛ we nɛ waa hia mumi yayami ɔ ngɛ nyumuyo ɔ mi ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Níhi kaa kikɛ ɔ, sɔlemi nɔ wawɛɛ a guu kɛ hiaa mɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Benɛ Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ si lejɛ ɔ, a tsa fiɛmi ɔ nɔ kɛ ya gu Galilea. Se e sume nɛ nɔ ko nɛ le he nɛ e ngɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e na be kɛ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Ejakaa e ngɛ mɛ nɔ titli ko tsɔɔe. E de mɛ ke, “A maa tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ nɛ a maa gbe lɛ. Se ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e maa te si ekohu kɛ je gbeje.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />E kaseli ɔmɛ nui nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ mɛ dee ɔ sisi; se a ngɛ gbeye hu yee kaa a ma bi lɛ nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ sisi. <verse eid="MRK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Benɛ a ya su Kapernaum nɛ a ya to we mi he nɛ a maa hi ɔ, e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni munyu he nɛ nyɛ ngɛ sɛsɛɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Se a nyɛ we lɛ heto nɛ a ha, ejakaa nɔ nɛ he nɛ a ngɛ huae ji a ti nɔ nɛ hine agbo pe kulaa.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ho hi si nɛ e tsɛ mɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ke nɔ ko ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee agbo pe kulaa ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, jamɛatsɛ ɔ nɛ pee e he nyɛ tsuo nyɛ sɔmɔlɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ jokuɛ nyafii ko kɛ ba da si ngɛ a hɛ mi nɛ e wo e nine ngɔ fɔ e konɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ jokuɛ nyafii kaa kikɛ ɔ atuu ngɛ ye biɛ mi ɔ, ami nɛ e ngɛ hee ɔ nɛ. Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ mi ɔ, Tsaatsɛ nɛ tsɔ mi ɔ nɛ e ngɛ hee ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ligbi ko ɔ, Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yohane ɔ de Yesu ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, wa na nɔ ko nɛ e wo o biɛ kɛ ngɛ mumi yayamihi hiae, nɛ akɛnɛ e be wa kpɛti he je ɔ, wa tsi e nya kaa e be he blɔ nɛ e peeɔ ja.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko de ke nyɛ ngɛ nɔ ko kaa ja a e nya tsie, ejakaa nɔ ko be nɛ e ma wo ye biɛ kɛ tsu nyakpɛ ni nɛ lɛ nɔuu e ma plɛ maa te si kɛ wo mi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ejakaa nɔ ko nɛ ti si ke wui wɔ ɔ, lɛɛ e ngɛ wa se. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma ha nyɛ nyu kplu kake ke nyɛɛ nu ngɛ ye we bi nɛ nyɛ ji he je ɔ, ma de nyɛ anɔkuale mi kaa e be yaka pee. Mawu nitsɛ maa haa lɛ tsumi ngɛ he. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Se mohu ji kaa, mo nɔ nɛ e maa je o he nɛ bi tsɔwi nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ ko nane maa tɔtɔ ɔ, afani nɛ a wo wɛ ngɔ muɔ mo jamɛatsɛ ɔ o kuɛ nɛ a ya sake mo ngɔ fɔ wo mi.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ke ji o nine maa de nɔ ha mo ɔ, moo po lɛ nɛ o sake lɛ ngɔ fɔ he. Afani nɛ o maa hɛɛ nine kpoku kɛ sɛ wami mi, pe nɛ o ninehi maa su ngɛ o he se a ma sake mo ngɔ fɔ gehena ngɛ Abosiamihi a je la a mi, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />he nɛ gɔgɔ ɔmɛ gbo we nɛ la a hu a gbi lɛ gblee ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Nɛ ke o nane ma gba o nya a, moo po lɛ ngɔ fɔ he. E hi mohu kaa o maa hɛɛ nane kake kɛ ya sɛ neneene wami mi pe nɛ o maa hi nane enyɔ nɛ a ma sake mo ngɔ fɔ neneene la a mi, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />he nɛ gɔgɔ ɔmɛ gbo we nɛ la a hu a gbi lɛ gblee ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Nɛ ke ji o hɛ ngmɛ ma ha nɛ o pee yayami ɔ, moo hia lɛ ngɛ o yi he nɛ o sake lɛ kɛ fɔ he. Ejakaa e maa hi ha mo kaa o kɛ hɛ ngmɛ kake ya sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi pe nɔ nɛ o hɛ ngmɛhi maa su ngɛ o yi he se a ma sake mo ngɔ fɔ Abosiamihi a je, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />he nɛ gɔgɔ ɔmɛ gbo we nɛ la a hu a gbi lɛ gblee ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />nɛ a ngɔɔ la kɛ woɔ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ ngo ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Nɔ kpakpa saminya ji ngo. Se ke mɛmɛɛmɛ ta ngo mi ɔ, kɛkɛ e he be se nami hu, ejakaa e be hiɛ nɛ a ma kɛ wo nɔ ko hu. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ ko ha nɛ ngɔɔmi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ nɛ ta. Se mohu nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hi si ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha munyuhi a heto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu je lejɛ ɔ kɛ ho Yudea ni ɔmɛ a mi ya nɛ e tsa nɔ kɛ ya su Yordan Pa a se. Ni ɔmɛ pa bu ba na lɛ nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ni kaa bɔ nɛ e pɔɔ peemi ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Nɛ Farisi bi komɛ ba nɛ a ba ta e nya mi. A bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ nyumu ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e fieɔ e yo lo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu hu bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni mlaa Mose wo nyɛ ngɛ gba puɛmi he?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />A ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Mose mlaa a ha he blɔ kaa nyumu ma nyɛ fie e yo faa. Nɔ pɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ maa pee ji kaa e ma ha yo ɔ fiemi womi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ e de ja? I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke nyɛ tue mi nɛ ti tsɔ ɔ he je nɛ Mose wo nyɛ mlaa kaa kikɛ ɔ ngɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Nyɛ nɛ, kɛ je adebɔ sisi jemi ɔ, Mawu bɔ nyumu kɛ yo. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyumu ma si e tsɛ kɛ e nyɛ nɛ e maa pɛtɛ e yo he . <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Nɛ mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ a maa pee he lo kake, a pi ni enyɔ hu. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ ko nɛ ko gba nɔ nɛ Mawu wo ngɔ tsa a mi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Pee se benɛ e piɛ mɛ sɔuu ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ gba sane ɔ he munyu ekohu.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e fieɔ e yo nɛ e ya ngɔɔ yo kpa a, e puɛ gba ngɛ kekle yo ɔ blɔ fa mi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Nɛ ja a kɛ ke yo kua e huno nɛ e ya gba nyumu kpa a, e puɛ gba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ligbi ko ɔ, benɛ binyɛ komɛ wo a bimɛ kɛ ma Yesu ngɔ nɛ e jɔɔ mɛ ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ wo fɔli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi la nɛ a fie mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Se benɛ Yesu na a, e mi mi fu e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ jokuɛwi ɔmɛ nɛ a ba ye ngɔ; nyɛ ko tsi mɛ blɔ, ejakaa mɛ mohu a nɔ ji Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ he we Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ kaa jokuɛwi nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, e be Matsɛyemi ɔ mi sɛe ligbi ko.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e wo jokuɛwi ɔmɛ kakaaka nɛ e wo e nine ngɔ pue a yi kpɛti nɛ e gbaa mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nɛ benɛ e maa ho blɔ hiami ya a, nyumu ko wo fo kɛ ba na lɛ nɛ e ba kpla si ngɛ e nane nya nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ kpakpa, kɛ ma pee kɛɛ nɛ ma na neneene wami?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi tsɛe ke Nɔmlɔ kpakpa? Nɔ ko be nɛ hine nɔmlɔ kpakpa, ja Mawu pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Tsɛ o le mlaa amɛ: Koo gbe nɔmlɔ, ko puɛ gba, koo ju, koo ye lakpa odase, koo sisi nɔ ko, moo bu o tsɛ kɛ o nyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Nyumu ɔ ha Yesu heto nɛ e de ke, “I tɔ we kita nɛ ɔmɛ a ti kake po nɔ hyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu hyɛ nɔmlɔ ɔ too nɛ e na e he suɔmi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Nɔ́ kake piɛ nɛ o pee we lolo. Mo ya jua o nihi tsuo nɛ o ngɛ ɔ nɛ o dla sika nɛ o ma na a kɛ ha ohiafohi nɛ o ma na ni ngɛ hiɔwe; konɛ o ba nɛ o ba nyɛɛ ye se.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nɛ nyumu ɔ nu munyu nɛ ɔ, e pee vii; nɛ e je lejɛ ɔ mɔbɔmɔbɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ níhi fuu.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu hyɛ e kuɛ se mi nɛ e yaa, nɛ e plɛ nɛ e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ e he wa ha niatsɛmɛ ha kaa a maa sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Yesu munyu ɔ pee e kaseli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi yaa. Se e ya nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Bimɛ, Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi sɛmi ngɛ yee saminya ha nihi nɛ wo a hɛ ngɔ fɔ je nɛ ɔ mi ni nami nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />E he wɛ ha afukpɔngɔ kaa e maa gu abui puɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ e he wa ha niatsɛ kaa e maa sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Sekpɛ munyu nɛ ɔ ha nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a nya mi jɔ. Nɛ a bɔni a he bimi ke, “Lɛɛ mɛnɔ kulaa yi wami nɛ a ma he mɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu hyɛ mɛ too nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nɔmlɔ be enɛ ɔ nyɛe maa pee, se Mawu lɛɛ nɔ́ ko be nɛ he wa ha lɛ. E nyɛɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ peeɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro de lɛ ke, “Wa ngmɛɛ wa nɔ tsuaa nɔ he nɛ wa ba nyɛɛ o se.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Nɛ Yesu de lɛ ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, nɔ ko be nɛ e si e we loo e nyɛmimɛ yihi loo nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi, loo tsɛ loo nyɛ loo bimɛ loo ngmɔ ngɛ ami kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ he nɛ a be lɛ nane mi toe ngwɔ he abɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />E ma na nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ngwɔ he lafa ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi, wehi kɛ nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi kɛ yihi, fɔli kɛ bimɛ kɛ zugba, nɔ nami kɛ dengme hulɔ, kɛ neneene wami ngɛ hwɔɔ se je nɛ maa ba a mi. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Se mohu nihi nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ mɛ ji kekleekle bimɛ ɔ, a ma plɛ sekpɛ bimɛ hwɔɔ se, nɛ nihi nɛ ji sekpɛ bimɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ, a ma ba pee hlami sɛli.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tu e gbenɔ he munyu ekohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Jehanɛ ɔ benɛ a pue nɔ kɛ yaa Yerusalem nɛ Yesu ngɛ hlami saii ha mɛ ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ bɔni gbeye yemi. Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu tsɛ mɛ nɛ e bɔni mɛ níhi nɛ maa ba e nɔ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ demi.<verse eid="MRK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />E de mɛ ke, “Ke wa ya su Yerusalem ɔ, a maa tsɔɔ Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ nɛ a maa ngɔ lɛ kɛ wo osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a dɛ. A maa bu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ nɛ a ma je e he gbi kɛ ha je mi bi ɔmɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />A maa ye e he fɛu nɛ a maa la lada kɛ pue e nɔ. A maa fiaa lɛ kpa nɛ a ma pue e hɛ mi si bɔ nɛ sɛ; nɛ nyagbe ɔ, a maa gbe lɛ. Se e nɔ ligbi nɛ ji etɛ ɔ se ɔ, e maa te si kɛ je gbeje.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane nɛ ji Zebedeo bi ɔmɛ ba Yesu ngɔ nɛ a ba de lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, wa ma bi mo nɔ ko nɛ o pee ha wɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni i lo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />A de lɛ ke, “Wa suɔ nɛ hwɔɔ se ɔ o ha nɛ wa ti nɔ kake nɛ hi o hiɔ nɔ nɛ nɔ kake hu nɛ hi o muɔ nɔ ngɛ o Matsɛyemi ɔ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ li nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ bie ɔ. Anɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ nɔ́ nami kplu nɛ i yaa nu ɔ maa nu lo? Aloo nyɛ ma nyɛ nɔ́ nami baptisimi nɛ a maa baptisi mi ɔ nya maa da lo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />A ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Ee, wa ma nyɛ!” Yesu ha mɛ heto ke, “Nyɛ ma nyɛ maa nu ye kplu ɔ nya nyu, nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ maa da ye baptisimi ɔ hu nya. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Se mohu ɔ, kaa nɔ ko maa hi ye hiɔ nɔ aloo e maa hi ye muɔ nɔ ɔ lɛɛ tsa pi ami nɛ i haa jamɛ a he blɔ ɔ, Mawu nɛ e ngɔ haa nihi nɛ e dla kɛ to ha mɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Benɛ kaseli kpa amɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ na le nɔ́ nɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ ya ngɛ bie ɔ, a na a he abofu saminya. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Se Yesu tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ le kaa ngɛ je mi bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ, matsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ni ngua amɛ yeɔ a sisi bi ɔmɛ a nɔ kaa nyɔguɛhi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Se e be ja ngɛ nyɛɛ nyɛ kpɛti. Nyɛ ti nɔ nɛ ngɛ hlae kaa e maa ye tsɛ aloo e maa pee nyɛ kpɛti nɔkɔtɔma a, e pee e he sɔmɔlɔ kɛ ha nyɛ tsuo. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Nɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ a tsɛ lɛ ngua pe kulaa a, e pee e he nɔ fɛɛ nɔ sɔmɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ejakaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ tete ɔ, e bɛ nɛ a sɔmɔ lɛ. Se mohu e ba nɛ e ba sɔmɔ nɛ e ngɔ e wami kɛ fɔ si ngɛ nihi fuu a yi wami hemi he.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />A tsa nɔ kɛ ya su Yeriko ma a mi. Nɛ pee se benɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ kpo jee ngɛ ma a mi ɔ, nihi fuu fie e se. Nɛ ni balɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Bartimeo, nɛ ji Timeo bi ɔ nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ yu ɔ hii si ngɛ blɔ ɔ he ngɛ ni bae.<verse eid="MRK 10:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Benɛ Bartimeo na le kaa Yesu nɛ je Nazaret ɔ nɛ bee ɔ, e bɔni ngmlaa kpami ngɛ dee ke, “Yesu, David Bi, moo na mi mɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Se ni komɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ke e yi ke e pee kɔ. Se si abɔ nɛ a ngɛ e yi kee ke e pee kɔ ɔ, si abɔ nɛ e ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ngɛ dee ke, “David Bi, moo na mi mɔbɔ!” ji lɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu ho da si nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ tsɛ lɛ ha mi!” Nɛ a tsɛ hɛ ngmɛ yuyuilɔ ɔ nɛ a de lɛ ke, “O he ngɛ ni. Moo te si nɛ o ba, e ngɛ mo tsɛe!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nɛ Bartimeo je e yi nɔ tade ɔ nɛ e sake lɛ kɛ fɔ he nɛ e te si tsa, nɛ e tataa si kɛ ya na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Nɛ Yesu bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni o ngɛ hlae nɛ ma pee ha mo?” E ha lɛ heto ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mo ha nɛ ma hyɛ nɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “Moo ho, o hemi kɛ yemi tsa mo!” Yesu nya mɛ si nɛ nyumu ɔ bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi; nɛ e fiɛ Yesu sɛ ke ho.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">A ya su Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Benɛ a ya su Betfage kɛ Betania ngɛ Nuyoku ɔ he, nɛ a maa ho Yerusalem sumi ya a, Yesu tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni enyɔ nɛ e tsɔ mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />E de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya kɔpe nɛ ngɛ wa hɛ mi nɛ ɔ mi. Nɛ ke nyɛ maa ho kɔpe ɔ mi sɛmi ya pɛ nyɛ maa na teji bi ko nɛ a muɔ lɛ si nɛ nɔ ko hi e nɔ hyɛ. Nyɛɛ pine lɛ nɛ nyɛ kpaka lɛ kɛ ba ha mi ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko bi nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ lohwe ɔ pinee ngɛ ɔ, nyɛ de lɛ ke, ‘E he hia wa Nutsɔ ɔ; nɛ e be kɛe nɛ e maa kpale lɛ kɛ ba.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Nɔuu nɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ ho nɛ a ya na teji bi ɔ nɛ a muɔ lɛ si ngɛ blɔ he ngɛ agbo ko nya. Nɛ benɛ a bɔni lɛ pinemi ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />ni komɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ lohwe ɔ pinee?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />A ha mɛ heto kaa bɔ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke a de ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ ni ɔmɛ de we nɔ́ ko hu.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />A kpaka lohwe ɔ kɛ ba ha Yesu nɛ a je a yi nɔ tade ɔmɛ ngɔ ha e nɔ nɛ Yesu ho hi si ngɛ nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni komɛ hu wo a tadehi ngɔ ngmɛ pue blɔ ɔ nɔ; nɛ ni komɛ hu ku bahi kɛ je pu ɔmɛ a mi ngɔ pue blɔ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />E nyɛɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ yaa, ni fa ngɛ e hlami nɛ ni fa hu ngɛ e se nɛ a ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ngɛ dee ke, “Hosiana! A jɔɔ nɔ nɛ ma ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Mawu nɛ gbaa wa tsɛ David matsɛ yemi ɔ nɛ kpale kɛ ma a. A gbaa je ɔ tsuo Matsɛ ɔ! Hosiana ngɛ hiɔwe plooplo!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Bɔ nɛ Yesu plɛ kɛ ya se Yerusalem ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ e be kɛ ho Sɔlemi We ɔ ya. E po he nɛ e hyɛ we ɔ mi kulaa kɛ kpe. Se jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, je maa ho jɔmi ya, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ e tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ a kpale kɛ ho Betania ya. <verse eid="MRK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />E nɔ jena benɛ a kpale kɛ je Betania kɛ ma a, hwɔ ngɛ lɛ yee. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Nɛ e na tso ko kaa mangoo tso ɔ jee ngɛ a hɛ mi kɛ e yi ba fuu. Nɛ e ho ya hyɛ ha kaa e wo lo. Se e ya nɛ yiblii kake po ngɛ tso ɔ nɔ, ejakaa tsa pi yiblii womi lebe i.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu hyɛ tso ɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Mo, o be yiblii ko woe hu kɛ je mwɔnɛ ɔ kɛ yaa!” Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ e de nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Benɛ a kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem ɔ, e pue nɔ kɛ ho Sɔlemi We ɔ ya. Nɛ benɛ e ya sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ pɛ nɛ e bɔni ni juali ɔmɛ kɛ sika tsakeli ɔmɛ fiemi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. E tsitsɛɛ ni juali ɔmɛ kɛ obleku lahuɛ juali ɔmɛ a okplɔɔ ɔmɛ kɛ sɛ ɔmɛ kɛ gba amɛ ngɔ pue si. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Nɛ e ngmɛ we blɔ kaa nɔ ko nɛ e tloo nɔ jua nɔ ko kɛ ba Sɔlemi We ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />E ka ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ e de ke, “A ngma ke, ‘Ye We ɔ maa pee sɔlemi he kɛ ha je ɔ tsuo.’ Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ plɛ lɛ ngɔ pee ojo fiali a laami he.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nɛ benɛ asafo nya dali ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ Yesu pee ɔ he ɔ, a bɔni e he ga hlami nɛ a kpata e hɛ mi. Se a ngɛ ni ɔmɛ gbeye yee kaa ke a gbe lɛ ɔ, gidigidi maa ba ma a mi, ejakaa Yesu ni tsɔɔmi ɔmɛ sa a hɛ mi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Jamɛ a gbɔkuɛ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ si ma a mi. <verse eid="MRK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />E nɔ jena mɔtu benɛ a bee ɔ, a na tso ɔ nɛ e gbiɛ ɔ kaa e gbo kɛ je zu mi tɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro kai nɔ́ nɛ Yesu de tso ɔ hiɛ ɔ, nɛ e kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, moo hyɛ, tso ɔ nɛ o gbiɛ ɔ gbo!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu ha heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ he Mawu nɔ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, mo nɔ nɛ o ma de yoku nɛ ɔ ke, ‘Hiaa nɛ o ya nɔ wo mi,’ nɛ o ji he nguane ngɛ o yi mi se mohu o he ye ɔ, yoku ɔ maa hia ya nɔ wo ɔ mi ngɛ o demi ɔ nya. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, ke nyɛ sɔle nɛ nyɛ bi nɔ́ ko ɔ, nyɛ he ye kaa nyɛ nine maa su nɔ, nɛ a ma ha nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ bi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Se mohu loko ji nyɛ maa sɔle ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ ke nɔ ko pee nyɛ yayami ko nɛ nyɛ ngɔ to nyɛ tsui mi ɔ, nyɛ ngɔ ke lɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ Tsɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ nɛ e wo nyɛ hu nyɛ tɔmi ɔmɛ tsuo ngɔ ke nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Nɛ ke nyɛ wo we nihi a yayami nɛ a pee nyɛ ɔ ngɔ ki mɛ ɔ, nyɛ Tsɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ hu be nyɛ tɔmi ɔmɛ woe ngɔ ke nyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ní nɛ ɔmɛ a se ɔ, a ba su Yerusalem nɛ benɛ e ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, asafo nya dali ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ ba na lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Nɛ a bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he blɔ o ngɛ nɛ o ngɛ níhi nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔmɛ pee? Mɛnɔ ha mo jamɛ a he blɔ ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Ma bi nyɛ munyu kake, nɛ ke nyɛ ha mi heto ɔ, ami hu i ma tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ he blɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɛ i kɛ ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsue. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />He blɔ kɛ he wami nɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ kɛ ngɛ nihi baptisie ɔ, anɛ Nɔmlɔ dɛ mi nɛ e je aloo Mawu dɛ mi i?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a bɔni a he kojomi. A bi a he ke, “Ke wa de ke Mawu ngɔ nɛ he blɔ ɔ je ɔ, e ma bi wɔ ke, ‘Lɛɛ mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ he we Yohane yi mɔ?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Nɛ ke wa de ke nɔmlɔ ngɔ nɛ he blɔ ɔ je hu, kɛkɛ lɛɛ gidigidi maa te si.” Ejakaa ma a he ye kaa Mawu ngɔ nɛ Yohane he wami ɔ je.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ha heto nɛ a de ke, “Wa li.” Yesu hu de mɛ ke, “Lɛɛ ami hu i be nyɛ he blɔ nɛ i ngɛ kɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ tsue ɔ tsɔɔe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Wai ngmɔ he abɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yesu bu mɛ abɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nyumu ko pee wai ngmɔ nɛ e fia gbogbo kɛ wo he; e pee wai ngami he ngɛ mi nɛ e ma hwɔɔmi he hu ngɛ abɔɔ ɔ mi, nɛ e wo abɔɔ ɔ ngɔ wo apaatsɛmɛ a dɛ nɛ e hia blɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Benɛ wai yiblii lami be ɔ su ɔ, ngmɔtsɛ ɔ tsɔ nɔ kɛ ho apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya nɛ e ya he e blɔ fa mi nɔ́ ba ha lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Se apaatsɛ ɔmɛ nu tsɔlɔ ɔ nɛ a fiaa lɛ ni saminya nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ ho ngmɔtsɛ ɔ ngɔ ya kɛ e dɛ mi gu.<verse eid="MRK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ngmɔtsɛ ɔ pa tsɔ e tsɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kpa kɛ ho apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya. Se apaatsɛ ɔmɛ nu tsɔlɔ nɛ ɔ hu nɛ a fiaa lɛ ni saminya kaa kekle nɔ ɔ, se lɛɛ a ywia e yi nɛ a fie lɛ kɛ je kpo ngɛ ngmɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ngmɔtsɛ ɔ tsɔ nɔ nɛ ji etɛne kɛ ho apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya; nɛ lɛɛ a gbe lɛ nɛ e gbo klanaa. Ngmɔtsɛ ɔ ya nɔ nɛ e tsɔ tsɔli kpahi kɛ ho apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya, se ja a kɛ̃ nɛ a pee mɛ tsuo, a gbe a ti ni komɛ nɛ a fiaa ni komɛ hu ni. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />E ba piɛ nɔ kake nɛ ji ngmɔtsɛ ɔ binyumu kake too. Kɛkɛ nɛ ngmɔtsɛ ɔ tsɔ lɛ kɛ ho apaatsɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ya. Nɔ nɛ e de e he ji, ‘Bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji ɔ, lɛɛ a maa bu lɛ.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Se benɛ apaatsɛ ɔmɛ na lɛ pɛ nɛ a de ke, ‘Nyɛ nɛ e ni yelɔ ɔ nɛ ma. Nyɛɛ ba nɛ waa gbe lɛ kɛkɛ ngmɔ ɔ maa pee wa ní!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a nu lɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ je ngmɔ ɔ mi nɛ a ya sake e gbogboe ɔ ngɔ fɔ he.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ kɛ nyɛ susu kaa ngmɔtsɛ ɔ maa pee kɛɛ? E maa ba nɛ e ma ba gbe apaatsɛ ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ e ma wo ngmɔ ɔ kɛ ha apaatsɛ kpahi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Anɛ nyɛ kane we Ngmami ɔ nɛ de ke, ‘Tɛ ɔ nɛ tsu fiali ɔmɛ sake ngɔ fɔ he ke e hí ɔ, e ba plɛ kɔ nya tɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ji enɛ ɔ nɛ, nɛ e ngɛ nyakpɛ kɛ gbeye ngɛ wa hɛ mi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">He nyɛli ka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ na paa kaa a he abɛ nɛ e bu ɔ nɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a bɔni e he blɔ hlami nɛ a nu lɛ; se a ya ye ma a gbeye nɛ a ngmɛɛ e he nɛ a je. <verse eid="MRK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a ya tsɔ Farisi bi kɛ Herode bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ kɛ ya Yesu ngɔ nɛ a ya ka lɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e de nɔ́ ko nɛ a da nɔ kɛ nu lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />A ba nɛ a ba bi lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, wa le mo kaa anɔkualetsɛ, o hlɛ nimli a mi nɛ o yi tue kpɛkpɛɛ sane hulɔ. Anɔkuale nɛ kɔɔ Mawu yi mi tomi kɛ ha nɔmlɔ ɔ pɛ nɛ o tsɔɔ. Mo de wɔ enɛ ɔ. Anɛ e da kaa wa woɔ lapoo kɛ haa Kaisare nɛ ji Roma Matsɛ ɔ aloo e dɛ? Waa wo aloo wa ko wo?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Yesu na a juɛmi kɛ ga nɛ a to ɔ, mɛ ja a he je ɔ, e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ba ngɛ mi klama tsɔe? Nyɛ ha mi sika a eko nɛ ma hyɛ ha.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Benɛ a wo sika a ba ha lɛ ɔ, e hyɛ sika a nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛnɔ yi kɛ hɛ mi nɛ a tɛni ngɛ sika a nɔ nɛ ɔ? Nɛ mɛnɔ biɛ nɛ a ngma ngɛ nɔ ɔ?” A ha lɛ heto ke, Roma Matsɛ ɔ nɔ́ i.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ke Kaisare nɔ i ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ wo Kaisare nɔ́ ngɔ ha Kaisare nɛ nyɛ wo nɔ́ nɛ ji Mawu nɔ́ ngɔ ha Mawu.” A munyu ɔ heto ɔ ha Yesu he pee mɛ nyakpɛ nɛ a nya mi jɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Saduki bi ɔmɛ hu ba Yesu ngɔ. Saduki bi ɔmɛ ji nihi nɛ mɛɛ a ke ke nɔmlɔ gbo ɔ kɛkɛ de e gbo hwɔɔ se gbogboehi a si temi ko be. Nɔ́ nɛ a ba bi lɛ ji,<verse eid="MRK 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Tsɔɔlɔ, Mose wo wɔ mlaa ke, ke nyumu ko ngɔ yo se e kɛ lɛ fo we nɛ nyumu ɔ si je mi ɔ, e nyɛminyumu nɛ ngɔ yo ɔ nɛ e kɛ lɛ nɛ a fɔ ha nɔ nɛ si je mi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />E ba mi kaa nyɛmimɛ nyumuhi kpaago hi si. A Tɛte ɔ ngɔ yo se e kɛ lɛ fɔ we nɛ e gbo. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Tɛtɛ ɔ ngɔ yo ɔ, nɛ lɛ hu e kɛ lɛ fɔ we nɛ e si je mi. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Nyɛmimɛ kpaago ɔ kulaa kɛ yo ɔ hi si nɛ a ti nɔ ko kɛ yo ɔ fɔ we. Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, yo ɔ hu ba gbo.<verse eid="MRK 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Hwɔɔ se ngɛ gbogboehi a si temi ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛmimɛ nɛ ɔmɛ a ti mɛnɔ maa pee yo ɔ huno, akɛnɛ yo ɔ gba mɛ tsuo ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ nui Ngmami ɔmɛ a sisi nɛ nyɛ li Mawu he wami ɔ hulɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tɔe ngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ejakaa hwɔɔ se ke nyɛmimɛ kpaago ɔmɛ kɛ yo ɔ te si ngɛ gbogboehi a si temi ɔ mi ɔ, gbami kɛ yo ngɔmi ko be, mɛ tsuo a maa pee kaa Hiɔwe bɔfohi.<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Nɛ kaa si temi ko ngɛ hwɔɔ se aloo si temi ko be ɔ, anɛ nyɛ kane we nɔ́ nɛ a ngma ngɛ Mose Womi nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ mi lo? Benɛ Mose na hue kpɔ ɔ nɛ ngɛ tsoe se e ngla we nɛ Mawu tsɛ lɛ kɛ je la a mi ɔ nɛɛ, kɛ Mawu de lɛ kɛɛ? E ke, ‘Ami ji Abraham Mawu, Isak Mawu kɛ Yakob Mawu ɔ nɛ.’<verse eid="MRK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Mawu ɔ tsa pi ni gbogboehi a Mawu i, se mohu hɛ kali a Mawu i. Nyɛ ngɛ tɔe tsɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Benɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ ngɛ mɛ tue bue ɔ na bɔ nɛ Yesu plɛ kɛ ha ni ɔmɛ heto ha a, e bi Yesu ke, “Mlaa amɛ tsuo a kpɛti te nɔ́ nɛ he hia pe kulaa nɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Mlaa a nɔ nɛ deɔ ke, ‘Moo bu tue Israel, Nutsɔ wa Mawu ɔ, Mawu kake too i. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Nɛ e sa nɛ o suɔ lɛ kɛ o tsui kulaa kɛ o he wami kulaa kɛ o juɛmi kulaa kɛ o susuma kulaa.’<verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Nɛ mlaa nɛ ji enyɔ ɔ ke, ‘Moo suɔ o nyɛmi nɔmlɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he ɔ.’ Mlaa ko be nɛ kle pe enɛ ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Mlaa Tsɔɔlɔ ɔ ha lɛ ayekoo nɛ e de ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, munyu ngwɔhe nɛ o tu ɔ nɛ. Anɔkuale ji kaa Mawu kake too pɛ nɛ ngɛ, nɛ e se ɔ, Mawu kpa ko be hu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Nɛ e ji anɔkuale kaa o suɔ lɛ kɛ o tsui kulaa kɛ o juɛmi kulaa kɛ o he wami kulaa kɛ o susuma kulaa, nɛ o suɔ o nyɛmi nɔmlɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he. Enɛ ɔmɛ a he hia kulaa pe afɔle sami mimi slɔɔto ɔmɛ tsuo ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Benɛ Yesu na kaa nyumu ɔ ngɛ nɔ sisi numi ɔ, e de lɛ ke, “O kɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ kpɛti kɛ we.” Nɛ enɛ ɔ se ɔ, nɔ ko nyɛ we nɛ e bi lɛ sane ko hu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Pee se benɛ Yesu ngɛ ni ɔmɛ nɔ́ tsɔɔe ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, e bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ deɔ ke Kristo ɔ David bibimibi ji lɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Mɛni he je ɔ, Mawu Mumi ɔ ngɔ wo David nitsɛ nya nɛ e de ke, ‘Mawu ye Nutsɔ ɔ ke, moo hi si ngɛ ye hiɔ nine nɔ kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma wo o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɔ pee o nane sisi sɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Ke David nitsɛ tsɛ lɛ ke Nutsɔ ɔ, kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ jamɛatsɛ ɔ ba hineɔ David bi kɛɛ?” E munyu ɔ ngɔ nihi fuu a nya nɛ a bu lɛ tue kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ni nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya ngɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a he. A suɔ nɛ a wo tade wuyaa kaa sikatsɛmɛ kɛ hi si slaae ngɛ gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ kɛ jua amɛ a nɔ konɛ nihi nɛ na mɛ nɛ a nga mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />A suɔ nɛ a hi nikɔtɔmahi a hi hehi ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ kɛ okplɔɔ yi ngɛ niye ni he ɔmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Se a ji nihi nɛ kpɔɔ yalɔyihi a weto nihi ngɛ a dɛ, se ke a sɔle plaa, o ma de ke a nɔ nimli kpakpa be he ko hu. Anɔkuale ji kaa hwɔɔ se ɔ, a tue gblami maa kle.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Nɛ Yesu ho ya hi si ngɛ onia tsumi daka a kasa nya ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ngɛ sika nɛ yi ɔmɛ kɛ ba ngɛ daka a mi woe ɔ hyɛe. Sikatsɛ ɔmɛ wo sika saii nitsɛ kɛ ngɛ daka a mi woe. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yo ohiafo ko nɛ e huno gbo hu ba nɛ e ba wo kaplɛ enyɔ nɛ sui pɛsua tete kɛ wo daka a mi.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Nɛ Yesu tsɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ ba e kasa nya nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ma de nyɛ anɔkuale mi kaa sika nɛ yalɔyo ohiafo nɛ ɔ kɛ ba wo daka a mi ɔ hiɛ hluu pe nɔ́ nɛ sikatsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ba tsu ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ejakaa sikatsɛ ɔmɛ lɛɛ a ni nɛ a na nɛ be nɔ ɔ mi nɛ a je kɛ ba ha nɔ́ nɛ a ha a nɛ. Se ahoyo ɔ lɛɛ ní tsɛ kɛ nyɛ nɛ ngɛ e dɛ ɔ kulaa nɛ e kɛ ba ha nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu tu nihi nɛ maa ba he munyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ, benɛ e ngɛ kpo jee ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ eko plɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ, mo nitsɛ moo hyɛ Sɔlemi We nɛ ɔ ha; moo hyɛ tɛ ɔmɛ a he fɛu ha. Anɔkuale ji kaa Sɔlemi We nɛ ɔ lɛɛ e hi!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu ha lɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Tsɛ o ngɛ tsu agbo nɛ ɔ hyɛe, be ma nɛ a maa ku lɛ tsuo ngɔ pue si; tɛ kake po be piɛe ngɛ tɛ nɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Benɛ a ya su Nuyoku ɔ nɔ ɔ, e ya ho hi si nɛ e plɛ e hɛ mi kɛ tsɔɔ Sɔlemi We ɔ. Nɛ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane kɛ Andrea ba e ngɔ ba bi lɛ zaa ke, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Mɛni be mi nɔ nɛ o de ngɛ Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ he ɔ maa ba mi? Nɛ mɛni ji okadi nɛ maa sɛ hlami kɛ tsɔɔ kaa be ɔ ngɛ sue?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu ha heto nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ saminya nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e ko ba mlɔɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ejakaa nihi fuu maa ba nɛ a ma ba de ke mɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ, nɛ a maa mlɔɔ nihi fuu. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nyɛ maa nu tahi kɛ ta sanehi a he, se nyɛ tsui nɛ ko po. Ejakaa níhi kaa ja maa ba, se lolo ɔ, be ɔ sui.<verse eid="MRK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Mahi ma gba ta ngɔ wo a bi, nɛ matsɛhi maa hia ta ya tua a bi. Zugba ma hoso ngɛ hehi fuu nɛ hwɔ maa ba. Se ni nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa kekle kɔɔmi nɛ yo nuu loko ji e fɔɔ bi. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Se ke ni nɛ ɔmɛ bɔni mi bami ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he nɔ nɛ hi, ejakaa nyɛ ngɛ haomi agbo mi. A ma wo nyɛ kɛ ya kojomi hehi, nɛ a maa fiaa nyɛ kpa ngɛ ma kpe he ɔmɛ. A maa nu nyɛ kɛ ya nɔ yeli ɔmɛ kɛ matsɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ngɛ ye se nyɛɛli nɛ nyɛ ji ɔ he je. Ke e ba mi ja a, nyɛɛ ngɔ lɛ kaa he blɔ nɛ nyɛ na nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ ye ye he odase ngɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Se ja a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ha je ɔ tsuo loko ji nyagbe ɔ maa su. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Nɛ ke a nu nyɛ kɛ yaa kojomi he ɔ, nyɛ ko ye tsui ngɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ ma ya de he. Se ke nyɛ ya su lejɛ ɔ, nyɛ de nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Tsɛ ɔ ma ngɔ wo nyɛ nya a. Ejakaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, tsa pi nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue, se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ i.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Nyɛmi maa tsɔɔ nyɛmi se blɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ; tsɛ maa tsɔɔ e bi se blɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ; nɛ bimɛ hu maa tsɔɔ a fɔli a se blɔ nɛ a gbe mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa nyɛ nyɛ ngɛ ye he; se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e be mi kuae, se e maa nyɛɛ ye se kɛ ya si nyagbe ɔ a ma he e yi wami.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Se anɔkuale ji kaa ke nyɛ na gbeye nɔ nɛ Gbalɔ Daniel tu he munyu ɔ kaa e maa si ngɛ he nɛ sɛ ɔ, mo nɔ nɛ o ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔ kanee ɔ, moo bu nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ tue saminya, moo ma fo kɛ sɛ Yudea yoku ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ke mo nɔ o ngɛ kɔɔhiɔ hemi he ngɛ tsu yi kpɛti ɔ, o ko de ke o ngɛ si kplee kɛ yaa wo nɔ ko ngɛ we ɔ mi. O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o je. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ke ngmɔ mi nɛ o ngɛ ɔ, o ko de ke o maa kpale kɛ ya wo o yi nɔ tade loo sika.<verse eid="MRK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Se due ha yihɔyihi kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ hɛɛ bimɛ ngɛ nyɔ nya jamɛ a be ɔ mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ nyɛ fo tumi ɔ nɛ e ko ya pee fiɛ be mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ejakaa jamɛ a be ɔ maa hine nɔ nami kɛ he hiami be nɛ a nɛ eko hyɛ kɛ je be nɛ a bɔ je ɔ; nɛ eko hu be bae hu. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Nɛ ja Nutsɔ ɔ po jamɛ a nɔ nami be ɔ nɔ kpiti, ke pi ja a, nɔ ko be piɛe. Se ngɛ nihi nɛ e hla amɛ a he je ɔ, e maa po be ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Nɛ ke nɔ ko de nyɛ ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi ke, ‘Nyɛ nɛ Kristo ɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ,’ aloo ‘Nyɛ nɛ lɛ nɛ yaa ngɛ lejɛ ɔ,’ nyɛ ko bu lɛ tue. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ejakaa nyangɔ gbali kɛ lakpa Kristo fuu maa te si ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ a maa pee nyakpɛ nihi slɔɔtohi kɛ mlɔɔ nihi nɛ Mawu nitsɛ hla a tete. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ i ngɛ nyɛ si woe kɛ fɔ si kaa nyɛ hɛ nɛ hi nyɛ he nɔ!<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, ngɛ nɔ nami kɛ he hiami ɔ se ɔ, pu maa wo diblii nɛ hlami be tsiɛe. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Nɛ hlami dodoe ɔmɛ ma tsɔ ba nɔ si; hiɔwe he wami ɔmɛ ma huanya nɛ a ma tsaka.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, je ɔ tsuo maa na Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ nɛ ma ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi kɛ he wami ngua kɛ anunyami. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Nɛ e maa tsɔ e bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ya je kɔ nya eywiɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ya bua ni nɛmɛ nɛ e hla amɛ a nya kɛ je zugba a nyata he kɛ ya si hiɔwe lokoo.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Nyɛɛ to tso ko kaa mangoo tso ɔ he hɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ kase nile nɛ ɔ, kaa ke be nɛ e kɔni ɔmɛ tsiɛ nɛ a bɔni ba bɔmi pɛ, nyɛɛ le kaa gbiɛ nya su. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyɛ na kaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa bɔni mi bami pɛ nyɛɛ le kaa ye bami be ɔ su ta.<verse eid="MRK 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Niinɛ, ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa maa ba mi loko ji yi nɔ nɛ ɔ maa be. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Hiɔwe kɛ zugba maa be kɛ ho, se ye munyu ɔmɛ maa hi si daa.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Se mohu jamɛ a ligbi ɔ kɛ ngmlɛfia a lɛɛ nɔ ko li, bɔfo ɔmɛ ngɛ hiɔwe po li, Bi ɔ li; Tsɛ ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e le. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Nyɛ hɛ nɛ hi nyɛ he nɔ, ejakaa nyɛ li benɛ be ɔ maa su.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ bami ɔ ngɛ kaa nɔ ko nɛ hia blɔ nɛ e si e we, nɛ e ha e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ni tsumi, nɛ e wo agbo nya hyɛlɔ ɔ si kaa e hwɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ja a he je ɔ, e bi nɛ nyɛɛ hwɔɔ, ejakaa nyɛ li be nɛ wetsɛ ɔ ma, eko ɔ gbɔkuɛ, eko ɔ nyɔ mi, eko ɔ makɛ loo mɔtu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ ke e ba tlukaa a, e ba na nyɛ nɛ nyɛ hwɔ mahe. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Nɔ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ, nyɛ kɛ je ɔ tsuo i ngɛ dee. Nyɛɛ hwɔɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu se blɔ tsɔɔmi kɛ e numi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Se jehanɛ ɔ e piɛ ligbi enyɔ pɛ nɛ a maa ye Hebemi kɛ Akpiti Ligbi ɔ. Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ bɔni Yesu he ga hlami bɔ nɛ a maa pee nɛ a nu lɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ ngɛ laami mi.<verse eid="MRK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Se a de a he ke, “E be hiɛ peemi ngɛ nyami be nɛ ɔ mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ basabasa nɛ ko ba te si.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Benɛ Yesu ngɛ Betania ngɛ Simon nɔ nɛ ngɛ hiɔ tsu nue we ɔ mi nɛ e ngɛ ni yee ɔ, yo ko ba je kpo ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ e dɛ mi nu je via tɔ kake nɛ he jua wa saminya. Yo ɔ hia nu ɔ nya nɛ e plɛ kulaa ngɔ pue Yesu yi kpɛti.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Se nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ a ti ni komɛ na yo ɔ he abofu, ejakaa e pee mɛ kaa e da nu ɔ, nɛ a bɔni e he munyu tumi. E je a ti ni komɛ a nya nɛ a de ke, “Mɛni nɔ dami ji enɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />A ko nyɛ jua nu nɛ ɔ sika fuu nɛ a ma kɛ ya ke ohiafohi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Se Yesu de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko hao yo ɔ. E tsu ni kpakpa kaa kikɛ ɔ ha mi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ e he mi kae? <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ohiafo ɔmɛ kɛ nyɛ ngɛ daa nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua mɛ be tsuaa be nɛ nyɛ suɔ. Se ami lɛɛ i kɛ nyɛ be si hiɛ daa.<verse eid="MRK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />E pee nɔ nɛ e ma nyɛ; e pɔ ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nu ngɔ fɔ si kɛ ha ye pumi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa he tsuaa he nɛ a maa fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ, a maa tsi nɔ́ nɛ e pee nɛ ɔ nɔ ta ngɔ tsɔɔ kɛ kai lɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ le ke Yuda Iskariot ɔ ho nɛ e ya na osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ Yesu se blɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Benɛ a nu amaniɛ nɛ Yuda hɛɛ ɔ, e ngɔ a nya saminya nɛ a wo lɛ si kaa a ma ha lɛ sika. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, lɛ hu e bɔni ga tomi bɔ nɛ e maa pee nɛ e nine maa su Yesu nɔ kɛ ha mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Akpiti Ligbi ɔmɛ a mi kekle ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, benɛ a ngɛ Hebemi to bi ɔmɛ gbee ɔ, Yesu kaseli ɔmɛ bi lɛ ke, “Jije o maa suɔ nɛ wa ya dla kɛ to mo nɛ o ya ye Hebemi Ligbi ɔ ngɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Nɛ Yesu tsɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni enyɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya Yerusalem ma a mi, nɛ ke nyɛ yaa a, nyɛɛ kɛ nyumu ko nɛ tloo nyu kɛ buɛ maa kpe. Nyɛɛ nyɛɛ e se. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />We mi he nɛ e ma ya sɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya de wetsɛ ɔ ke, ‘Wa Nutsɔ ɔ ke waa ba nɛ o tsɔɔ wɔ tsu mi he nɛ o dla kɛ to wɔ nɛ wa ma ba ye Hebemi ni ɔ ngɛ gbɔkuɛ nɛ ɔ.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, e maa tsɔɔ nyɛ asa ngua ko nɛ a dla kɛ fɔ si ngɛ hiɔwe tsu ɔ nɔ. Nyɛ ya to níhi a he blɔ nya ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ ha wa ni yemi ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ pue blɔ kɛ ho ma a mi ya nɛ a ya na nɔ tsuaa nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Yesu de mɛ ɔ, nɛ a ya pee Hebemi niye ni ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Gbɔkuɛ mi ɔ, Yesu kɛ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ kulaa ho we ɔ mi ya. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Benɛ a pue si nɛ a ngɛ ni ɔ yee ɔ, Yesu de mɛ ke, “I ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi ke, nyɛ ti nɔ kake nɛ e kɛ mi ngɛ ni yee amlɔ nɛ ɔ maa tsɔɔ ye se blɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Munyu nɛ ɔ hao e kaseli ɔmɛ saminya nɛ a bɔni lɛ bimi kakaaka ke, “Ami i lo? Ami i lo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ nyɛ ti nɔ kake i, nɔ nɛ e nine kɛ ye nine ngɛ kpee ngɛ kaa mi amlɔ nɛ ɔ i. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Anɔkuale ji kaa Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ma gbo kaa bɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ de ɔ, se due ha nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ e se blɔ ɔ. E ko hi kaa a fɔ we lɛ mohu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nɛ benɛ a ngɛ ni ɔ yee ɔ, e wo abolo ɔ eko, nɛ e jɔɔ nɔ. E poo mi nɛ e ngɔ kɛ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye, ye Nɔmlɔ tso ji enɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Lɔ ɔ se ɔ, e wo kplu kɛ e mi wai ɔ, nɛ benɛ e jɔɔ nɔ se ɔ, e wo ngɔ ha mɛ nɛ mɛ kulaa a nu eko. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Enɛ ɔ ji ye muɔ nɛ ji Somi He ɔ nɛ ngɛ Mawu kɛ adesa kpɛti ɔ, nɛ a ngɔ pue si kɛ ha nihi fuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee anɔkuale mi kaa i pa be wai nɛ ɔ eko nue hu kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma nu ekpa mimi ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Enɛ ɔ se benɛ a la yi jemi la kɛ wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami ɔ, a je kpo kɛ ho Nuyoku ɔ nɔ ya.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Nɛ Yesu de mɛ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ, nyɛ tsuo nyɛ ma kua mi. Ejakaa a ngma nɛ a de ke, ‘I ma fia to kpakalɔ ɔ nɔ́ kɛ fɔ si nɛ to ɔmɛ maa gbɛ kɛ fia.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Nɛ benɛ a tle mi si kɛ ba wami mi ekohu se ɔ, i ma sɛ nyɛ hlami nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ma ya kpe ngɛ Galilea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Se Petro de lɛ ke, “Ke nɔ tsuaa nɔ kua mo ɔ, ami Petro lɛɛ i be mo kuae gblee!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu de lɛ ke, “I ngɛ mo dee anɔkuale mi ke, nyɔ nɛ ɔ mi tutuutu ɔ, kungwɔ be nae ma kpa nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔne nɛ o ma ka kita si etɛ kɛ kua mi ke o li mi kulaa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Se Petro ka pe kekle ɔ po nɛ e de ke, “Ke e maa ba mi kaa i kɛ mo wa gbo tete po ɔ, i be kpalee ngɛ ose!” Nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ hu de ja a kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Benɛ a ya su he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Getsemane ɔ, e de e kaseli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ ma ya sɔle nɛ ma ba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nɛ e tsɛ Petro kɛ Yakobo kɛ Yohane ngɔ piɛ e he; kɛkɛ nɛ e bɔni haomi ngɛ e mi saminya. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Nɛ e de ni etɛ ɔmɛ ke, “Ye susuma ngɛ haoe ngɛ ye mi kɛ yaa su gbenɔ mi tete. Nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mi nɛ fɔ nyɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />E si mɛ nɛ e nyɛɛ kɛ ya e hɛ mi bɔɔ nɛ e ya ho hi si ngɛ zugba nɛ e sɔle nɛ e de ke, ke e maa hi ɔ ngmlɛfia yobu nɛ ma a nɛ e be ngɛ e yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Bɔ nɛ e kpa pɛɛ nɛ e de ji, “Tsaatsɛ, Tsaatsɛ , o nyɛɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ o peeɔ, mo ha nɛ kplu nɛ ɔ nɛ be ngɛ ye yi. Se mohu tsa pi bɔ nɛ ami i suɔ se bɔ nɛ mo Tsaatsɛ o suɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Se benɛ e kpale kɛ ba e kaseli etɛ ɔmɛ a ngɔ ɔ, e ba na kaa a hwɔ mahe. Nɛ e tsɛ Petro nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Simon, lɛɛ nyɛ be nyɛe nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mi maa fɔ nyɔ ngmlɛfia kake pɛ lo? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, nyɛ tsuo nyɛɛ kɛ mi nɛ fɔ nyɔ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ Nyatsɔlɔ ɔ nɛ ko ye nyɛ nɔ. Mumi ɔ ngɛ kplɛɛe mohu se he lo ɔ nɛ gbɔjɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e pa si mɛ nɛ e ho ya sɔle nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔ nɛ e de bɔ nɛ e de kekle ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nɛ e kpale kɛ ba a ngɔ ekohu nɛ e ba na mɛ nɛ a hwɔ mahe, ejakaa nyɔ gbe mɛ nɛ a hɛ ngmɛ jiɔ nɛ a li nɔ́ nɛ tete po nɛ a ma de.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />E pa si mɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji si etɛ. Nɛ benɛ e kpale kɛ ba a, a hwɔ mahe pɔpɔɔpɔ. Yesu tsɛ mɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ngɛ mahe ɔ hwɔe kɛ sa lo? Bɔ nɛ nyɛ hwɔ mahe ɔ e hiɛ. Ngmlɛfia a su. A tsɔɔ yayami peeli Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ se blɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Nyɛɛ te si nɛ waa ho. Ye se blɔ tsɔɔlɔ ɔ su hiɛ ɔ ta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />E nya nɔɛ si nɛ Yuda nɛ ji e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ɔ ba je kpo kɛ e se nihi nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ tsɔ kɛ piɛ e he kɛ a dɛ mi ta yami hahi kɛ tso kpotihi.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda kɛ nihi nɛ piɛ e he ɔ tu ngɔ to ke, “Ke wa ya su ɔ, nɔmlɔ nɛ i ma ya fua atuu nɛ i ma nya e he ɔ, lɛ tutuutu i, nyɛɛ nu lɛ nɛ nyɛ wo lɛ kɛ ho.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Lɔ ɔ he je benɛ a ba su he nɛ Yesu kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ ngɛ ɔ, Yuda ya de ke, “Tsɔɔlɔ!” Nɛ e fua lɛ atuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni ɔmɛ nu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake hia ha nɛ e po Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a tsɔlɔ ɔ tue.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Nɛ Yesu bi ni ɔmɛ ke, “Anɛ ojo fialɔ ji mi nɛ nyɛ ba mi numi kɛ nyɛ dɛ mi klaatehi kɛ tso kpotihi nɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Daa nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ i hii ni ɔmɛ nɔ́ tsɔɔe ɔ, mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ nui mi? Se a ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo pee konɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ngma a nɛ e ba mi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ tsuo tu fo si lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Se niheyo ko nɛ kɛ klala kpiti muɔ e mlɛ mi ɔ fie Yesu se; nɛ benɛ ni ɔmɛ na lɛ ɔ, a ka kaa a maa nu lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Se e kpa e klala kpiti ɔ ngɔ ha mɛ nɛ e tu fo kɛ si mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Nɛ ni ɔmɛ kpaka Yesu kɛ ho Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a we ɔ mi ya nɛ osɔfo ngua amɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ kulaa a bua ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petro fie ni ɔmɛ a se ngɛ se lokoo kɛ ya sɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a we ɔ mi, se e tlɔ kpo ɔ nɔ nɛ e ya futu tsɔli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ la hluie ɔ a kpɛti. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ kpe he ɔ kulaa hla munyu pɔtɛɛ nɛ a ma ngɔ wo Yesu he konɛ a da nɔ kɛ bu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ se a nɛ eko. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Nihi fuu ba ye lakpa odase slɔɔtohi kɛ si lɛ, se a odase ɔmɛ sɔɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, ni komɛ hu te si nɛ a ye lakpa odase kɛ si Yesu nɛ a de ke, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nu paa nɛ e de ke, ‘Ami lɛɛ i ma hule Sɔlemi We nɛ ɔ nɛ a wo nine kɛ ma a, nɛ ligbi etɛ se ɔ, i ma ma ekpa nɛ tsa pi nine nɛ i ma wo kɛ ma.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Se a odase ɔmɛ hu sɔɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a te si da si nɛ e bi Yesu ke, “O be munyuhi abɔ nɛ a kɛ ngɛ o he woe nɛ ɔ eko kulaa nya jee lo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Se Yesu ha we lɛ heto nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a kpale bi lɛ ke, “Mo ji Kristo, Mawu Bi ɔ lo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu ha heto nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ami tutuutu i, nɛ nyɛ maa na Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ nɛ e kpale kɛ ma zugba a nɔ ngɛ hiɔwe bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a gba e he tade nɛ e de ke, “Mɛni odase kpa wa pa ngɛ hlae? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ nu musu bɔmi munyu nɛ e tu ɔ. Kɛ nyɛ ngɛ dee kɛɛ?” Kɛkɛ nɛ kpe ɔ kulaa bu Yesu gbenɔ fɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, ni komɛ bɔni lada sumi kɛ e nɔ puemi, nɛ a fi e hɛ mi nɛ a bɔni lɛ nɔ́ simi. Ke a si lɛ nɔ́ ɔ, kɛkɛ a de lɛ ke, “Moo kla koo! Mɛnɔ si mo nɔ́ ɔ?” A ye e he fɛu, nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a we bi ɔmɛ kongo lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Benɛ enɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ, Petro ngɛ kpo ɔ nɔ ngɛ la hluie. Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a we ɔ mi sɔmɔli yi ɔmɛ eko ba na Petro nɛ e ngɛ la hluie. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />E hyɛ lɛ too nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Tsɛ mo hu o kɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ nɛ je Nazaret ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Se Petro de lɛ ke, “E be mi! I li nɔ nɛ o ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ!” Kɛkɛ nɛ e si lejɛ ɔ kɛ ho se ya. Nɛ nɔuu ɔ, kungwɔ kpa nɔ<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Se yoyo ɔ ngɛ lɛ hyɛe kɛ sa nɛ e de ni ɔmɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ke, “A ti nɔ kake ji lɔ ɔ nɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Se Petro kplɛɛ we nɔ lolo. Be bɔɔ se ɔ, ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ bɔni Petro demi ekohu ke, “Bɔ tsuaa bɔ nɛ ji ɔ, a ti nɔ kake ji mo. Ejakaa Galilea nɔ ji mo, nɛ o munyu tumi hu ngɛ ja a tsɔɔe paa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Petro bɔni mɛ gbiɛmi kɛ kita kami ke, “Kpaoo, e be mi! I li Nɔmlɔ nɔ nɛ he munyu nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tue nɛ ɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Se Petro nya mɛ si nɛ kungwɔ kpa nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro kai munyu nɛ Yesu tu ke, “Loko ji kungwɔ ma kpa nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔ ɔ, o ma kua mi si etɛ ke o li mi ɔ” Nɛ Petro hia ya.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kojomi kɛ e sɛumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Benɛ je na a, osofo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ kɛ ma kpe ɔ kulaa ya kpe nɛ a wo Yesu kɔsɔkɔsɔ nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Pilato hɛ mi ya.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato bi Yesu ke, “Anɛ mo ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ lo?” E ha heto nɛ e de Pilato ke, “Ja a ji bɔ nɛ o de ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ po munyu slɔɔtohi ngɔ fɔ e nɔ, se e pɛ nya mi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato pa bi lɛ ke, “O be munyu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɔ wo o he nɛ ɔ eko kulaa heto hae lo?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Se Yesu kpɛ we e kuɛ si; nɛ Pilato hɛ mi pee lɛ yaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Daa ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ a jeha a yee ɔ, Pilato ngmɛɛɔ Yuda bi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔ a ti nɔ kake he kɛ haa mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />E ba mi kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a wo Yuda nɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Baraba kɛ ni komɛ tsu mi ngɛ nɔ ko nɛ a gbe ngɛ ma a atuã tsɔmi kɛ basabasa peemi mi ɔ he.<verse eid="MRK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ma a bi Pilato kaa e pee bɔ nɛ e peeɔ daa jeha ngɛ Hebemi be ɔ mi ɔ kɛ ha mɛ. Nɛ Pilato ha mɛ heto nɛ e bi ke, <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />“Nyɛ suɔ kaa ma ngmɛɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ he ha nyɛ lo?”<verse eid="MRK 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ejakaa e na paa kaa ninyɛ kɛ he tai he je nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ nu Yesu ngɛ nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ ba ha lɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Se osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ wo ma a yi mi kaa a bi Pilato nɛ e ngmɛɛ Baraba mohu he ha mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Pilato bi ma a ekohu ke, “Lɛɛ mɛni nyɛ suɔ kaa ma pee nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsɛɛ ke Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Nɛ mɛ tsuo a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Moo sɛu lɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he je? Mɛni yayami nɛ e pee?” Se kpaloko ji a kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ pe kekle ɔ ke, “Moo sɛu lɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Nɛ akɛnɛ Pilato ngɛ gbeye yee kaa basabasa maa te si, nɛ e suɔ hu kaa e he hɛ mi fini he je ɔ, e ngmɛɛ Baraba he nɛ e ha a fiaa Yesu kpa nɛ e wo lɛ ngɔ ha ma a nɛ a ya sɛu lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ soja amɛ kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Amlaalo ɔ mwɔ ɔ mi ya nɛ a tsɛ soja amɛ nɛ ngɛ mwɔ ɔ he bue ɔ kulaa kɛ ba lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a wo tade tsutsu ko ngɔ wo lɛ; nɛ a bɔ mio kla ngɔ bu e yi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a bɔni e he fɛu yemi nɛ a ngɛ lɛ ngae ke, “Mo he manye, Yuda bi a matsɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Nɛ a wo tso kɛ fiaa e yi nɛ a la lada kɛ pue e nɔ nɛ a kpla si ngɛ e hɛ mi ke a ngɛ lɛ jae.<verse eid="MRK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Benɛ a ye e he fɛu bɔ nɛ a ma nyɛ se ɔ, a kpɔ tade tsutsu ɔ ngɛ e he, nɛ a wo lɛ nitsɛ e tade ɔmɛ ngɔ wo lɛ, nɛ a kpaka lɛ kɛ ho nɛ a ya sɛu lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Benɛ a yaa ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, a kɛ nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Simon nɛ je Kirene, nɛ ji Aleksandra kɛ Rufus a tsɛ ɔ ya kpe nɛ e ma ma a mi, nɛ a nyɛ e nɔ nɛ a wo Yesu sɛumi tso ɔ ngɔ tloo lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ ya su he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Golgata, nɛ e sisi ji Yikokonohe. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a ha lɛ wai nɛ a wo mi tsopa, se e kua numi. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Lɔ ɔ se ɔ, a ka lɛ kɛ wo sɛumi tso ɔ he. Nɛ a fɔ e tade ɔmɛ a nɔ sɔ kɛ dla mɛ ngɔ ha a he.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Be mi nɛ a ke sɛu lɛ ɔ ji mɔtu ngmlɛ nɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Nɛ a ngma munyu nɛ a kɛ wo e he ɔ ngɔ fɔ e yi mi je ke, “Yuda bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Jamɛ a mɔtu ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, a sɛu ojo fiali enyɔ hu ngɔ piɛ e he, nɔ kake ngɛ e hiɔ nɔ, kɛ nɔ kake hu ngɛ e muɔ nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Ngmami ɔ nɛ de ke, “Nɛ a bu lɛ kɛ piɛ yayami peeli a he” ɔ ba mi.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Nɛ nihi nɛ ba be ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ye e he fɛu nɛ a hoso a yi nɛ a de ke, “Mo nɛ o ke o maa hule Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ nɛ o maa kpale ma lɛ ekohu ngɛ ligbi etɛ mi ɔ, mo ji enɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Mo kple si kɛ je sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ nɛ o he mo nitsɛ o yi wami.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ mlaa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ hu ye e he fɛu nɛ a de ke, “Ni kpahi a yi wami nɛ e heɔ, se lɛ nitsɛ e yi wami lɛɛ e nyɛ we hemi.<verse eid="MRK 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Tsa pi lɛ ji Kristo Israel matsɛ ɔ? E kple si kɛ je sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ kɛkɛ wa ma he lɛ maa ye!” Ni enyɔ ɔ mɛ nɛ a sɛu ngɔ piɛ e he ɔ hu ye e he fɛu.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Pu dadɛ mi ɔ, diblii wo ngɛ zugba a nɔ kulaa kɛ ya si ngmlɛ etɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Nɛ benɛ a fia ngmlɛ etɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ, Yesu kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?” E sisi ji, “Ye Mawu, Ye Mawu, mɛni he je nɛ o kua mi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, a ti ni komɛ nɛ nu ɔ de ke, “Nyɛɛ hyɛ, e ngɛ Elia tsɛe.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ ko ma fo ya wo kutsa nɛ e wo ngɔ tsɔ wai nɛ duɔ mi nɛ e ngɔ kɛ hɔ tso nya kɛ mane lɛ. Nɛ benɛ e wo kɛ ngɛ lɛ manee ɔ, e de ke, “Nyɛ ha waa hyɛ ha kaa Elia ma ba je lɛ kɛ je sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ lo?”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ Yesu hia ngmlaa wawɛɛ nɛ e ngɔ e mumi ɔ kɛ ha.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Amlɔ ɔ mi ɔ, Sɔlemi We ɔ mi dlami bo ɔ mi gba enyɔ fiee kɛ je hiɔmi kɛ ba ma si.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Nɛ benɛ Roma soja amɛ a nɔkɔtɔma nɛ ji lafa a nyatsɛ nɛ daa si ngɛ e ha nɔ ɔ na bɔ nɛ e plɛ kɛ ngɔ e nya a, e hia ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Niinɛ, Nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu Bi ji lɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Yi komɛ hu daa si ngɛ se ngɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ hyɛe. Mɛ ji Maria Magdalena kɛ Maria nɛ ji Yakobo Wayo kɛ Yosefmɛ a nyɛ kɛ Salome kɛ yi kpa komɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Yi nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa ji Yesu se nyɛɛli nɛ sɔmɔ lɛ benɛ e ngɛ Galilea a, kɛ yi kpahi fuu nɛ nyɛɛ e se kɛ ba Yerusalem ɔ hu daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Benɛ du bɔni bumi ɔ, akɛnɛ ligbi ɔ hine he dlami ligbi, nɛ ji ligbi nɛ nyɛɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ hɛ mi he je ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosef nɛ je Arimatia, nɛ e ji Kpe Ngua a mi nɔ nɛ a buu lɛ saminya, nɛ e ngɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ bami blɔ hyɛe ɔ, pee ka nɛ e ya Pilato nitsɛ ngɔ. E ya bi lɛ nɛ e ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e ya je Yesu gbogboe ɔ kɛ je sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Benɛ Pilato nu kaa nɔmlɔ ɔ gbo momo o, e pee lɛ nyakpɛ saminya. E tsɔ nɛ a ya tsɛ sojahi lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ kɛ ba nɛ e bi lɛ kaa e gbo kɛ lo? <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nɛ benɛ lafa a nyatsɛ ɔ ba ma nɔ mi ɔ, e ngmɛɛ gbogboe ɔ he ha Yosef.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosef ya he klala kɛ ba nɛ e ba je gbogboe ɔ ngɛ tso ɔ he nɛ e wo klala a ngɔ blaa e he. Nɛ e ya dla lɛ ngɛ yɔkɔ nɛ a kpɛ ngɛ tɛ sa mi ɔ mi, nɛ e kpɛne tɛ ngɔ tsi muɔ ɔ nya.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Nɛ Maria Magdalena kɛ Maria nɛ ji Yosef nyɛ ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a na he nɛ e to Yesu ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu si temi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Gbɔkuɛ mi benɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ be ɔ, Maria Magdalena kɛ Salome kɛ Maria nɛ ji Yakobo nyɛ ɔ ya he tsopa kɛ he via nɛ a ma kɛ ya wo gbogboe ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ja a he je ɔ, e nɔ jena nɛ ji otsi ɔ kekle ligbi ɔ nɔ benɛ pu ke e tee si pɛ nɛ a ho yɔkɔ ɔ he ya. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Benɛ a yaa a, a bɔni susumi kaa mɛnɔ po nɛ e ma kpɛne tɛ ɔ kɛ je muɔ ɔ nya ha mɛ lo?<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Se benɛ a ke a maa hyɛ ɔ, a na kaa a kpɛne jamɛ a tɛ agbo ɔ kɛ je muɔ ɔ nya nɛ muɔ ɔ nya fɔɔ si. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nɛ benɛ a sɛ muɔ ɔ mi ɔ, a na niheyo ko nɛ hii si ngɛ a hiɔ nɔ ma je nɛ e wo tade futa; nɛ a tsui po. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Se bɔfo ɔ de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ko ye gbeye! Nyɛ ngɛ Yesu nɛ je Nazaret ɔ nɛ a sɛu lɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ ji ligbi etɛ ɔ hlae lo? E te si. Nyɛ nɛɛ, he nɛ a to lɛ ngɛ ɔ ji nɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nyɛɛ kpale mohu nɛ nyɛ ya bɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ Petro hu amaniɛ ke, e sɛ nyɛ hlami kɛ yaa Galilea. Nyɛ maa na lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e wo nyɛ si ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ yi ɔmɛ wo fo kɛ je yɔkɔ ɔ he nɛ bibi gbe mɛ. A de we nɔ ko nɔ ko, ejakaa gbeye nu mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Hɔgba makɛ ji be nɛ Yesu te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ nɛ. Nɛ nɔ kekle nɛ e je e he si ngɔ tsɔɔ ji Maria Magdalena, nɔ nɛ e je mumi yayamihi kpaago kɛ je e mi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Lɛ nɛ e ya bɔ kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ kɔmɔ yee, nɛ a ngɛ ya foe ɔ amaniɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />E de mɛ ke e te si nɛ e hɛ ngɛ, se a he we lɛ yi.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Pee se ngɛ jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔuu nɔ ɔ, e je e he si ngɛ blɔ kpa nɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ e kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni enyɔ be mi nɛ a ngɛ nyɛɛe kɛ je Yerusalem kɛ yaa kɔpe ko mi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ hu ya bɔ a nyɛmimɛ kaseli kpa amɛ amaniɛ kaa a na lɛ; se mɛ hu nɔ ko he we mɛ yi.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e je e he si ngɔ tsɔɔ e kaseli nyɔngma kɛ kake nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ be mi nɛ a bua a he nya ngɛ ni yee. Nɛ e ka a hɛ mi ngɛ a tsui wami ɔ he je, kaa a he we amaniɛ nɛ nihi nɛ na lɛ ɔ bɔ mɛ ɔ nɛ a ye, kaa e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Jehanɛ ɔ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya je ɔ mi tsuo nɛ nyɛ ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ ha nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ a bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ ma he maa ye nɛ a maa baptisi mɛ ɔ, a ma he a yi wami; nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ be hee maa ye ɔ, a maa bu mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Nɛ a ma ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ ma he maa ye ɔmɛ he wami nɛ a ma tsu nyakpɛ ni slɔɔtohi. A maa hiaa mumi yayamihi ngɛ ye biɛ mi nɛ a maa tu gbihi nɛ nɔ ko nui hyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />A ma fiɛ sinɔ duɔtsɛmɛ a he nɛ a be mɛ nɔ́ ko pee. Nɛ ke ji a nu nɔ́ ko nɛ duɔ ngɛ mi hu e be mɛ gbee. Nɛ ke a wo a nine ngɔ to hiɔtsɛmɛ a nɔ ɔ, a ma na he wami.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Benɛ e kɛ mɛ tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ se ɔ, a wo lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya, nɛ e ya hi si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Se e kaseli ɔmɛ lɛɛ a hia blɔ ya fiɛ Munyu ɔ ngɛ he tsuaa he. Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ mɛ tsu ni nɛ e wo a munyu ɔmɛ he wami kɛ gu nyakpɛ nihi nɛ nyɛɛ a munyu ɔmɛ a se ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>